# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:8
translate english c20_32c3c0e6:

    # "{b}Esto es todo por esta versión. Por favor, graba aquí y nos vemos en la próxima actualización de My Dorm. Gracias por jugar y por tu apoyo. Espero que hayas disfrutado del juego.{/b}"
    "{b}That's all for this update. Please save here and see you in the next update of My Dorm. Thanks for playing and for your support. I hope you enjoyed the game.{/b}"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:87
translate english c20s001_Setup_ad614493:

    # mc "Entonces, ¿cómo funciona esto? ¿Tú nos explicas lo que pasa y nosotros decidimos qué hacemos?"
    mc "So, how does this work? You explain to us what happens, and we decide what we do?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:88
translate english c20s001_Setup_89ca20aa:

    # dap "Más o menos. En base a lo que tu personaje sabe hacer... ahora te pasaré la hoja de personaje para que lo sepas..."
    dap "More or less. Based on what your character knows how to do... I'll hand you the character sheet so you can check it..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:89
translate english c20s001_Setup_8fca7167:

    # dap "Tú decides lo que quieres hacer o no. Pero siempre intentando mantenerte fiel a cómo has diseñado a tu personaje, su personalidad, sus creencias... y sus habilidades."
    dap "You decide what you want to do or not. But always try to stay true to how you've designed your character, their personality, their beliefs... and their abilities."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:91
translate english c20s001_Setup_f02e660c:

    # sca "Por ejemplo, mi hechicera, no va a poder decir que le pega con la espada a alguien, porque no tiene espada y tiene otras herramientas más útiles."
    sca "For example, my Sorceress won't be able to say that she hits someone with her sword, because she doesn't have a sword and has other more useful tools."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:92
translate english c20s001_Setup_9c9e6ec5:

    # sca "Además de que tiene cierta alergia a meterse en combate cuerpo a cuerpo."
    sca "Besides the fact that she has a certain allergy to getting into hand-to-hand combat."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:93
translate english c20s001_Setup_864c3d12:

    # mc "Entonces es un poco como teatro de improvisación..."
    mc "So, it's a bit like improv theater..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:95
translate english c20s001_Setup_cfab1ca2:

    # dap "Es exactamente eso, pero como es un juego, tú dirás qué quieres hacer, yo decidiré la dificultad, y tirarás un dado. No usamos del todo las reglas del libro oficial, pero se parecen."
    dap "It's exactly that, but since it's a game, you'll say what you want to do, I'll decide the difficulty, and you'll roll a die. We don't entirely use the rules from the official book, but they're similar."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:96
translate english c20s001_Setup_b7257763:

    # mc "Vale, lo entiendo. ¿Pero cómo sabré qué aspecto tiene cada cosa? ¿Vas a describir absolutamente todo? Puede ser un poco aburrido tener que describir de qué madera está hecha una mesa, ¿no?"
    mc "Okay, I get it. But how will I know what anything looks like? Are you going to describe absolutely everything? It can get a little boring having to describe what wood a table is made of, won't it?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:98
translate english c20s001_Setup_879c04c5:

    # dap "*Risa* No hace falta llegar a ese nivel de detalle. Yo te diré que hay una mesa, y tú te la imaginas. Da lo mismo que tú la imagines de pino y Scarlett de nogal."
    dap "*Laugh* You don't have to reach that level of detail. I'll tell you there's a table, and you'll imagine it the way you want. It doesn't matter if you imagine it to be pine and Scarlett imagines it to be walnut."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:99
translate english c20s001_Setup_218b7938:

    # dap "Si la mesa tiene algo importante, por ejemplo un dibujo, eso sí que lo describiré."
    dap "If the table has something important on it, a drawing, for example, I will describe it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:100
translate english c20s001_Setup_f03ed4e5:

    # mc "Pero entonces, cada uno estaremos imaginando cosas diferentes, ¿no? Aunque supongo que no es importante..."
    mc "But then, we'll each be imagining different things, won't we? Although I guess it's not really important..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:102
translate english c20s001_Setup_fa7537ce:

    # eri "No, no lo es. Mi personaje tiene cuernos. Da lo mismo que los imagines de vaca o de carnero."
    eri "No, it isn't. My character has horns. It doesn't matter if you imagine them as a cow or a ram's horns."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:103
translate english c20s001_Setup_1439ef68:

    # eri "¿[emm] no ha llegado aún? Creía que seríamos las últimas."
    eri "[emm] isn't here yet? I thought we'd be the last ones."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:104
translate english c20s001_Setup_f812bbd3:

    # mc "No, sólo queda ella."
    mc "No, she's the only one not here yet."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:106
translate english c20s001_Setup_c800fb56:

    # mad "Piensa también que nosotros vamos a tener que describir cosas. Por ejemplo, mi personaje se parece mucho a mí, pero tiene el pelo completamente negro, típico asiático."
    mad "Note that we will have to describe things, too. For example, my character looks a lot like me, but she has completely black hair, typical Asian hair."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:107
translate english c20s001_Setup_8d1b48b6:

    # mad "Si es importante, lo describimos. Si no, no. Por ejemplo, nunca te diré de qué color lleva pintadas las uñas Fang, o si las lleva pintadas. Porque no es importante."
    mad "If it is important, we'll describe it. If it's not, we won't. For example, I'll never tell you what color Fang's nails are painted, or if she wears any paint at all. Because it's not important."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:109
translate english c20s001_Setup_61effa05:

    # emm "¿Cómo que no es importante? Paula usa la manicura francesa... *Risa* Aunque supongo que aquí será la manicura gala."
    emm "What do you mean it's not important? Paula uses the French manicure... *Laugh* Although I guess it would be the Gaulish manicure here."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:110
translate english c20s001_Setup_f1028286:

    # mc "Quizás lo que es importante para tu personaje no lo es para otros. Creo que lo voy entendiendo."
    mc "Maybe what is important to your character is not important to others. I think I'm getting it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:112
translate english c20s001_Setup_8d43c5c5:

    # dap "Bueno, pues podemos empezar, ¿no?"
    dap "Well, we can get started, can't we?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:113
translate english c20s001_Setup_6ea3f481:

    # dap "Ahora que la artista está aquí, os hemos preparado esto. Son nuestros pequeños regalos por uniros a nuestra noche de Damiselas y Dragones."
    dap "Now that the artist is here, we have prepared these for you. They are our little gifts for joining our Damsels and Dragons night."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:114
translate english c20s001_Setup_d806beff:

    # dap "Las ha pintado [emm]."
    dap "[emm] painted them."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:116
translate english c20s001_Setup_65289082:

    # mad "¡Oh, es preciosa! ¡Muchas gracias!"
    mad "Oh, it's beautiful! Thank you very much!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:118
translate english c20s001_Setup_f7f30b9b:

    # mc "¡Es increíble! No es exactamente como me imaginaba mi personaje, pero es muy bonita."
    mc "It's amazing! He's not exactly how I pictured my character, but the figurine is really cool."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:119
translate english c20s001_Setup_70b8745b:

    # mc "Supongo que el rango de figuras a elegir es limitado, y esta se parece lo suficiente."
    mc "I guess the range of figurines to choose from is limited, and this one looks close enough."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:120
translate english c20s001_Setup_d33d8aba:

    # dap "Por eso quise hacer los personajes el miércoles. Así hemos tenido tiempo de comprarlas y de que [emm] las pintara."
    dap "That's why I wanted to roll the characters on Wednesday. That way we had time to buy them and for [emm] to paint them."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:121
translate english c20s001_Setup_26f57419:

    # mc "Muchas gracias a las dos. Es una pasada."
    mc "Thank you both very much. It's so cool."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:123
translate english c20s001_Setup_780c0937:

    # eri "Estas son las nuestras. [emm] es una artista pintando figuritas."
    eri "These are ours. [emm] is an artist at painting figurines."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:124
translate english c20s001_Setup_def4f53c:

    # emm "Gracias, [eri]. Es muy divertido pensar en cómo se ven los personajes y pintarlos para que lo reflejen."
    emm "Thank you, [eri]. It's a lot of fun to think about what the characters look like and paint them to reflect it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:125
translate english c20s001_Setup_fa48e519:

    # mc "Son preciosas también."
    mc "They are beautiful as well."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:127
translate english c20s001_Setup_89115ae2:

    # dap "Y estas son las de Scarlett y la mía. Fue la única figura que encontré con martillo, armadura, y trenza. Como siempre, [emm] hizo un gran trabajo."
    dap "And these are Scarlett's and mine. It was the only figure I could find with a hammer, armor, and a braid. As always, [emm] did a great job."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:128
translate english c20s001_Setup_90d3f77e:

    # sca "Todas estamos muy agradecidas a [emm]. Nunca encontré una figura que se pareciera a como imagino a Beagan, mi hada, pero me encanta cómo la pintó [emm]."
    sca "We're all very grateful to [emm]. I never found a figure that looked like how I imagined Beagan, my fairy, but I love how [emm] painted her."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:129
translate english c20s001_Setup_55b16e1f:

    # mc "Me encantan todas. [emm], tienes talento para esto."
    mc "I love them all. [emm], you have a talent for this."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:130
translate english c20s001_Setup_0c5f9b95:

    # mad "Desde luego que sí. Yo no podría darles tantos detalles aunque quisiera, en una cosa tan pequeña."
    mad "Of course she has. I couldn't paint them so detailed even if I wanted to. It must be hard to do on such a small thing."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:132
translate english c20s001_Setup_0d1711fd:

    # emm "Bueno, ¿empezamos a jugar o me vais a hacer ruborizar?"
    emm "Well, shall we start to play or are you going to make me blush?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:133
translate english c20s001_Setup_786f4bd2:

    # mc "Si te ruborizas, tus mejillas se pondrán rosas e irán a juego con tu pijama, con lo que supongo que estarás contenta. *Risa*"
    mc "If you blush, your cheeks will turn pink and match your pajamas, which I guess you'll be happy with. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:134
translate english c20s001_Setup_94cdb4d9:

    # mc "Pero mejor que empecemos antes de que se haga más tarde."
    mc "But we'd better get started before it gets too late."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:136
translate english c20s001_Setup_469251ab:

    # dap "Pues la cosa empieza en una taberna casi vacía. Vilfredo ([mc]) y Fang (Maddie) habéis llegado a Novum Templum, un pueblo a unas 50 millas romanas (74 km, 46 millas) al sur de Vindobona (Viena)."
    dap "Well, it starts in an almost empty tavern. Vilfredo ([mc]) and Fang (Maddie), you have arrived at Novum Templum, a town about 50 Roman miles (74 km, 46 miles) south of Vindobona (Vienna)."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:137
translate english c20s001_Setup_fcd1e1b3:

    # dap "Trabajabais como guardias de caravanas y os habéis quedado sin trabajo. Vuestra caravana continuará hacia Vindobona siguiendo a una cohorte que se dirige a la ciudad."
    dap "You were working as caravan guards and are out of a job. Your caravan will continue on to Vindobona following a cohort heading for the city."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:138
translate english c20s001_Setup_af02e767:

    # dap "Os habéis separado para ver si había alguna caravana que escoltar de vuelta a Italia y habéis quedado en la taberna. Vilfredo es el primero en llegar."
    dap "You split up to see if there was a caravan to escort back to Italy and arrange to meet at the tavern. Vilfredo is the first to arrive."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:139
translate english c20s001_Setup_c52973c5:

    # dap "Ya os puse en antecedentes antes de lo que habíais encontrado. Espero que lo recordéis."
    dap "I gave you a background before on what you had found. I hope you remember it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:141
translate english c20s001_Setup_7c05e06f:

    # dap "¿Qué haces, [mc]?"
    dap "What do you do, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:142
translate english c20s001_Setup_8cea8046:

    # mc "No sé, supongo que me acerco al tabernero..."
    mc "I don't know... I guess I approach the tavern keeper..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:144
translate english c20s001_Setup_6d93ebf4:

    # dap "Tabernera... Una cosa curiosa que habéis visto es que, en este pueblo, hay muy pocos hombres."
    dap "She's a woman... One peculiar thing you have seen is that, in this town, there are very few men."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:146
translate english c20s001_Setup_a2cc78cb:

    # mcp "(Es difícil imaginarse la taberna de una forma diferente a como era el Black Crow Inn donde estuvimos [dap] y yo.)"
    mcp "(It's hard to imagine the tavern any different than the Black Crow Inn was when [dap] and I were there.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:147
translate english c20s001_Setup_4edf73ed:

    # mc "Me acerco a pedir una cerveza... Hay cerveza, ¿no?"
    mc "I'm coming over to order a beer... There's beer, isn't there?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:148
translate english c20s001_Setup_abd4fdf1:

    # dap "*Risa* Sí, hay cerveza. Pídeme la cerveza."
    dap "*Laugh* Yes, there is beer. Order the beer from me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:149
translate english c20s001_Setup_b1f22b4f:

    # mc "¿A tí? Creía que tú formabas parte del grupo, no sabía que eras la tabernera."
    mc "From you? I thought you were part of the group, I didn't know you were the tavern keeper."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:153
translate english c20s001_Setup_09084277:

    # sca "Todos los personajes que no llevamos los que estamos sentados alrededor de la mesa, los interpreta [dap]. La tabernera, el centurión, los malos, etc."
    sca "All the characters not played by those of us seated around the table are portrayed by [dap]. The tavern keeper, the centurion, the bad guys, etc."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:154
translate english c20s001_Setup_f13de050:

    # mc "Eso tiene que ser muy complicado... pero empiezo a entenderlo... Volvamos a ello."
    mc "That must be very complex... but I'm beginning to understand it... Let's get back to it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:156
translate english c20s001_Setup_b160a080:

    # mcd "Buenos días, Sra. Tabernera..."
    mcd "Good morning, Mrs. Tavern Keeper..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:157
translate english c20s001_Setup_d2d7fcd0:

    # mc "¿Cómo es la tabernera, [dap]?"
    mc "What's the tavern keeper like, [dap]?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:158
translate english c20s001_Setup_1995aabb:

    # dap "Cocina genial, con lo que la diseñé para que se pareciera a Tía Martha..."
    dap "She cooks great, so I designed her to look like Aunt [mar]..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:158
translate english c20s001_Setup_f0ee9eac:

    # dap "Cocina genial, con lo que la diseñé para que se pareciera a Tía [mar]..."
    dap "She cooks great, so I designed her to look like Aunt [mar]..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:159
translate english c20s001_Setup_65b8bc18:

    # emm "Pero pelirroja. *Risa*"
    emm "But redhead. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:160
translate english c20s001_Setup_7d36fb27:

    # dap "*Risa* Sí, en este pueblo verás que casi todas las mujeres son pelirrojas. Imáginate a Tía Martha, pero pelirroja."
    dap "*Laugh* Yes, you'll find out that almost all the women are redheads in this village. Picture Aunt [mar], but as a redhead."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:160
translate english c20s001_Setup_0766b7c4:

    # dap "*Risa* Sí, en este pueblo verás que casi todas las mujeres son pelirrojas. Imáginate a Tía [mar], pero pelirroja."
    dap "*Laugh* Yes, you'll find out that almost all the women are redheads in this village. Picture Aunt [mar], but as a redhead."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:161
translate english c20s001_Setup_a86e4ed3:

    # mc "OK, volvamos a ello... antes de que alguien se enfade porque hayas diseñado una [mar] pelirroja."
    mc "OK, let's get back to it... before someone gets mad because you designed a redheaded [mar]."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:163
translate english c20s001_Setup_bf7603a9:

    # mcd "Buenos dias, Hermosa Tabernera, ¿me podrías servir dos cervezas? ¿Y si puede ser, también vuestro nombre?"
    mcd "Good morning, Gorgeous Tavern Keeper, could you pour me two beers and, if possible, give me your name too?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:164
translate english c20s001_Setup_6264a77f:

    # eri "*Risa* ¿Estás ligando con Marzia?"
    eri "*Laugh* Are you flirting with Marzia?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:165
translate english c20s001_Setup_0f417cda:

    # mc "No. *Risa* Pero llamarle Hermosa Tabernera cada vez no me parece apropiado."
    mc "No. *Laugh* But it doesn't seem appropriate to call her Gorgeous Tavern Keeper every time."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:166
translate english c20s001_Setup_5464ebc9:

    # unk "Siéntese en esa mesa y ahora se la llevo."
    unk "Sit down at that table and I'll bring them to you in a moment."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:167
translate english c20s001_Setup_04c58e32:

    # dap "Tira por Carisma. Necesitas sacar 12 o más, incluído tu bono de Carisma, lo puedes ver en tu ficha. Con ese dado no, con el más grande. 13+3."
    dap "Roll for Charisma. You need to roll 12 or more, including your Charisma bonus, you can see it in your sheet. Not with that die, with the larger one. 13+3."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:168
translate english c20s001_Setup_065103e1:

    # marziad "Y me llamo Marzia, Señor..."
    marziad "And my name is Marzia, Mr. ..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:174
translate english c20s001_Setup_cf7fa571:

    # mcd "Vilfredo il Bisteccone."
    mcd "Vilfredo il Bisteccone."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:177
translate english c20s001_Setup_a4f9badd:

    # mc "Una pregunta, [dap]. Si todo el mundo habla latín aún, mi nombre no tiene mucho sentido, es en italiano..."
    mc "One question, [dap]. If everyone still speaks Latin, my name doesn't make much sense, it's in Italian..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:178
translate english c20s001_Setup_906dd9ca:

    # dap "El latín ha evolucionado en los últimos 900 años de guerras e invasiones. No es el mismo latín que se hablaba en la época de la República."
    dap "Latin has evolved over the last 900 years of wars and invasions. It is not the same Latin that was spoken at the time of the Republic."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:179
translate english c20s001_Setup_cd35320e:

    # dap "Además, hay dialectos. No hablan el mismo latín en Egipto que en Roma. Como no tengo ni idea de latín, Scarlett y yo decidimos que el italiano era un sustituto aceptable como dialecto para esta zona."
    dap "Besides, there are dialects. They don't speak the same Latin in Egypt as they do in Rome. Since I have no idea about Latin, Scarlett and I decided that Italian was an acceptable substitute as a dialect for this area."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:180
translate english c20s001_Setup_4cb431b6:

    # mc "Ah, vale. Pues me siento a esperar que la Hermosa Marzia me traiga mi cerveza."
    mc "Ah, okay. Well, I'll just sit back and wait for the Gorgeous Marzia to bring me my beer."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:183
translate english c20s001_Setup_9b9e041c:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* A los pocos minutos ves llegar a Fang, el personaje de Maddie. Descríbete, Maddie."
    dap "*In the real world* A few minutes later you see Fang, Maddie's character, arrive. Describe her, Maddie."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:184
translate english c20s001_Setup_276571dd:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* 26 años, alta, pelo largo en una coleta, armadura de cuero, un arco... y un tigre como compañero. Se llama Júpiter."
    mad "*In the real world* 26 years old, tall, long black hair in a ponytail, leather armor, a bow... and a tiger as a companion. His name is Jupiter."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:185
translate english c20s001_Setup_40b7d00b:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Yo soy un semielfo, con armadura de cuero, y coleta. Mi tono de piel es un poco oscuro, ya que mi parte élfica es de un elfo oscuro varias generaciones atrás."
    mc "*In the real world* I am a Half-elf, with leather armor, and a ponytail. My skin tone is a bit dark, as my elven side is from a dark elf several generations back."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:186
translate english c20s001_Setup_213be83f:

    # mcp "(Hay algo mal con el personaje de Maddie... todo el mundo sabe que, para las armaduras femeninas, cuanto menos cubren, más protegen, ¿no?)"
    mcp "(There's something wrong with Maddie's character... everyone knows that, for female armor, the less it covers, the more it protects, right?)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:197
translate english c20s001_Setup_879daccd:

    # mcp "(Mucho mejor.)"
    mcp "(A lot better.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:199
translate english c20s001_Setup_d5d355ab:

    # marzia "¡Hey, tú! No puedes entrar aquí con ese animal..."
    marzia "Hey, you! You can't come in here with that..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:201
translate english c20s001_Setup_a4c30875:

    # mcp "(Júpiter... equivalente romano de...)"
    mcp "(Jupiter... Roman equivalent of...)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:203
translate english c20s001_Setup_3c221c26:

    # mcp "(Zeus. *Risa*)"
    mcp "(Zeus. *Laugh*)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:204
translate english c20s001_Setup_3fb43df7:

    # jup "*Ronroneo*"
    jup "*Purr*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:206
translate english c20s001_Setup_ac4497d0:

    # marzia "Con ese animal precioso y que no le demos un poco de leche."
    marzia "With that beautiful animal and we won't give him any milk."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:207
translate english c20s001_Setup_ca750346:

    # mcp "(¡Claro! ¡También me puedo imaginar diálogos poco importantes si [dap] no dice lo contrario!)"
    mcp "(Of course! I can also imagine unimportant dialogues if [dap] doesn't say otherwise!)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:208
translate english c20s001_Setup_81e12d86:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* ¿Qué contestas, [mc]?"
    dap "*In the real world* What do you answer, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:209
translate english c20s001_Setup_f339e49a:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Perdón, me había perdido en mis pensamientos... ¿Puedes repetirme la pregunta?"
    mc "*In the real world* Sorry, I zoned out... Can you repeat the question?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:211
translate english c20s001_Setup_b28e2415:

    # madd "¿Has encontrado alguna caravana?"
    madd "Did you find any caravans?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:212
translate english c20s001_Setup_975d579b:

    # mcd "No, no hay nadie en este pueblo que nos quiera contratar de vuelta a Italia."
    mcd "No, there is no one in this village who wants to hire us back to Italy."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:214
translate english c20s001_Setup_c20c58e5:

    # madd "A mí me ha pasado lo mismo. Es un pueblo muy pequeño y las caravanas vienen tan solo a cargar grano y se van. Por lo visto tienen un excedente enorme, pero la nuestra era la última."
    madd "The same thing happened to me. It's a very small town and the caravans come just to load grain and leave. Apparently, they have a huge surplus, but ours was the last one."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:215
translate english c20s001_Setup_d54cedb3:

    # madd "Creo que tendremos más suerte si vamos a Vindobona. Es la frontera y posiblemente hayan caravanas que vayan a comerciar con los Enanos."
    madd "I think we'll have better luck if we go to Vindobona. It's the border and possibly there will be caravans going to trade with the Dwarves."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:216
translate english c20s001_Setup_3502e5df:

    # mcd "Pues acabémonos las cervezas y vamos a los establos. ¡Camino a Vindobona!"
    mcd "Well, let's finish our beers and go to the stables. On our way to Vindobona!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:218
translate english c20s001_Setup_49730201:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Mientras os tomáis las cervezas entra de golpe una chica, de unos 18 años, en la taberna. Es una chica con orejas de gato y cola de zorro."
    dap "*In the real world* While you are drinking your beers a girl, about 18 years old, suddenly enters the tavern. She's a girl with cat ears and a fox tail."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:219
translate english c20s001_Setup_01800182:

    # unk "¡Marzia! ¡Han venido los inquisidores de BDSM! ¡Están montando follón en el foro!"
    unk "Marzia, the BDSM inquisitors are here! They're making trouble in the forum!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:220
translate english c20s001_Setup_eb68a3fb:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* ¿BDSM? Estás de broma, ¿no?"
    mc "*In the real world* BDSM? You're kidding, aren't you?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:221
translate english c20s001_Setup_456ea966:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* No, es una organización de fanáticos religiosos, los Bellum Dei Salvum Me (La Guerra Sagrada Me Salvó). *Risa* Más tarde descubrí lo que significaban esas siglas..."
    dap "*In the real world* No, it's an organization of religious fanatics, the Bellum Dei Salvum Me (Holy War Saved Me). *Laugh* I later found out what that acronym stood for..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:222
translate english c20s001_Setup_0ef8a387:

    # sca "*En el mundo real* Ni siquiera la traducción es del todo correcta. La hicimos con Foogle. Y espera a ver como se llaman algunos de los miembros."
    sca "*In the real world* Even the translation is not quite accurate. We did it with Foogle. And wait till you see what some of the members are called."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:224
translate english c20s001_Setup_9dd1e803:

    # marziad "¿Dónde están las Protectoras, Thiel?"
    marziad "Where are the Protectors, Thiel?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:225
translate english c20s001_Setup_351fad61:

    # emm "*En el mundo real* *Risita* Esas somos nosotras..."
