    marziad "Alba! Take care of the customers!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:234
translate english c20s001_Setup_d6b3297f:

    # madd "Deberíamos ir a ver. ¡Odio a esos fanáticos religiosos!"
    madd "We should go check it out. I hate those religious fanatics!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:235
translate english c20s001_Setup_cf5909a9:

    # mcd "Vamos, aunque no sé si deberíamos intervenir. No sabemos de qué va todo esto."
    mcd " Let's go, although I don't know if we should interfere. We don't know what this is all about."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:236
translate english c20s001_Setup_dab3dc2a:

    # madd "Yo sí. Hace unos años quemaron una ménagerie en Capua porque decían que había brujas faéricas allí. Fue donde rescaté a Júpiter."
    madd "I do. A few years ago, they burned a menagerie in Capua because they said there were Fairy witches there. It was where I rescued Jupiter."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:237
translate english c20s001_Setup_2cdc190b:

    # jup "*Ronroneo enfadado*"
    jup "*Angry purr*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:242
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_0888ae7c:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Salís de la taberna y os dirigís al foro. Es un foro minúsculo, pero es que el pueblo es muy pequeño."
    dap "*In the real world* You leave the tavern and head for the forum. It's a tiny forum, but that's because the village is very small."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:243
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_b19cc9b0:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Poco más de veinte casas, la taberna, unos almacenes de grano, una herrería, un templo clásico y las ruinas de un templo élfico dentro de un recinto amurallado."
    dap "*In the real world* Just over twenty houses, the tavern, some grain stores, a smithy, a classical temple and the ruins of an elvish temple within a walled enclosure."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:244
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_b3ff3ce7:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Hace siglos era un fuerte de las legiones que servía para controlar la entrada a la ruta de los Alpes."
    dap "*In the real world* Centuries ago it was a legion fort that served to control the entrance to the Alpine route."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:245
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_62235fde:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Delante del templo clásico veis un grupo de seis personas. Dos alabarderos, dos arqueras, un guerrero y un clérigo. El clérigo empieza a hablar justo cuando llegáis."
    dap "*In the real world* In front of the classical temple you see a group of six people. Two halberdiers, two archers, a warrior and a Cleric. The Cleric starts talking just as you arrive."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:246
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_492485ce:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* No hay prácticamente nadie escuchándolo."
    dap "*In the real world* There is virtually no one listening to him."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:247
