    marzia "You are not welcome here. As a member of the Women's Council, I ask you to leave. Anyway, you can see that you didn't gather much of an audience."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:347
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_58e2327e:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Ciertamente, veis que, aparte de Marzia, Thiel, y vosotros, solo hay cinco o seis personas más. Un par de ellos parecen claramente forasteros."
    dap "*In the real world* You can see that, apart from Marzia, Thiel, and you, there are only five or six other people. A couple of them clearly look like outsiders."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:349
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_a585e30f:

    # emmd "Ya habéis oído a la dama. Os queremos fuera de este pueblo antes de que caiga el sol."
    emmd "You heard the lady. We want you out of this town before the sun goes down."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:351
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_19537d55:

    # dapd "Que aquí no haya Vigiles (algo parecido a la policía en el Imperio Romano) no significa que esto sea un pueblo sin ley."
    dapd "Just because there are no Vigiles (something akin to the police in the Roman Empire) here doesn't mean this is a lawless town."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:352
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_cc6a56ce:

    # dapd "El Consejo de Mujeres nos ha pedido que velemos por la seguridad de los habitantes de Novum Templum."
    dapd "The Women's Council asked us to look after the safety of the people of Novum Templum."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:354
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_9942e96f:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Solomon alza el brazo en dirección a Marzia y a Thiel. Con el pulgar hacia abajo."
    dap "*In the real world* Solomon raises his arm towards Marzia and Thiel. With his thumb down."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:355
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_93743923:

    # sold "¡Coged a esa perra pelirroja y a la aberración que tiene como mascota! A ver si tiene valor para prohibirnos estar aquí cuando esté encadenada."
    sold "Get that red-haired bitch and the aberration she has for a pet! Let's see if she has the courage to forbid us to be here when she's chained up."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:357
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_b85a817f:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Uno de los alabarderos se dirige a Marzia. ¿Qué hacéis?"
    dap "*In the real world* One of the halberdiers heads for Marzia. What do you do?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:358
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_8ff7e9a0:

    # emm "*En el mundo real* Paula se interpone entre el alabardero y ella."
    emm "*In the real world* Paula steps between the halberdier and her."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:359
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_6986e3ae:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Estás al otro lado de la plaza, demasiado lejos. Eso podrían hacerlo [mcd] o [madd]. O Scarlett podría lanzar algún hechizo."
    dap "*In the real world* You're on the other side of the square, too far away. Only [mcd] or [madd] can do that. Or Scarlett could cast a spell."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:360
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_f17e0d6b:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Me interpongo yo. Desenvaino las armas."
    mc "*In the real world* I stand in the way. I draw my weapons."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:361
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_82c02c7a:

    # eri "*En el mundo real* Yo me acerco por el otro flanco... hacia donde está el otro alabardero."
    eri "*In the real world* I approach on the other flank... towards where the other halberdier is."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:362
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_dc6e6d53:

    # sca "*En el mundo real* Me hago pequeña y subo volando al almacén que hay delante del templo."
    sca "*In the real world* I become small and fly up to the warehouse in front of the temple."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:363
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_fed6056b:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* Saco una flecha y apunto a las arqueras. Júpiter se pone en posición amenazante."
    mad "*In the real world* I draw an arrow and aim at the archers. Jupiter gets into a threatening stance."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:365
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_318fb9b9:

    # mcp "(Mejor que vuelva a ser un tigre en este caso.)"
    mcp "(Better go back to being a tiger in this case.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:366
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_a7b8b1bf:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Pia se desplaza hacia el centro del foro."
    dap "*In the real world* Pia moves to the center of the forum."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:367
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_9a82f405:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Scarlett, ¿puedes poner las figuras? Ya sabes la disposición inicial."
    dap "*In the real world* Scarlett, can you set up the figurines, please? You know the initial layout."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:368
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_024f4ff1:

    # sca "*En el mundo real* [mc], pon estas figuras y esos dados ahí y ahí, por favor."
    sca "*In the real world* [mc], put these figurines and those dice there and there, please."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:370
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_c6502af4:

    # sca "Los d4 son los alabarderos, los d6 las arqueras, el d8 Euricus, el d10 Solomon, y los d12 Marzia, rojo, y Thiel, naranja. Júpiter es el d6 naranja."
    sca "The d4 are the halberdiers, the d6 the archers, the d8 Euricus, the d10 Solomon, and the d12 Marzia, red, and Thiel, orange. Jupiter is the orange d6."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:371
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_e93f92f0:

    # dap "[mc], el alabardero intenta apartarte con su arma. ¿Qué haces?"
    dap "[mc], the halberdier is trying to push you away with his weapon. What do you do?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:372
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_dd508b8b:

    # mc "¿Puedo apartar el arma?"
    mc "Can I push the halberd away?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:373
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_c3478f92:

    # dap "Tira el dado. Necesitas más de 15. 1. ¡Uff!. Scarlett, pon otro d12 a la izquierda de Marzia, delante de Thiel."
    dap "Roll the die. You need more than 15. 1. Scarlett, put another d12 to Marzia's left, in front of Thiel."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:374
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_55352a74:

    # mc "Eso es malo, ¿no? ¿No le sumo nada?"
    mc "That's bad, isn't it? Don't I add anything to it?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:376
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_bd15a166:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Apartas la alabarda, pero no mides correctamente la fuerza, y tanto el alabardero como tú perdéis un poco el equilibrio."
    dap "*In the real world* You put the halberd away, but you don't measure the force correctly, and both the halberdier and you lose your balance a bit."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:377
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_af67a93c:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* El contrapeso del arma impacta contra la mejilla de un chico que ha avanzado al lado de Marzia, intentando proteger a Thiel."
    dap "*In the real world* The weapon's counterweight impacts against the cheek of a boy who has advanced to Marzia's side, trying to protect Thiel."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:378
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_8d2f7c47:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* *Tirando dados* Le hace un pequeño corte en la mejilla. Un uno en el dado es la peor puntuación posible, [mc]. Se llama pifia."
    dap "*In the real world* *Rolling dice* Gives him a small cut on the cheek. A one on the die is the worst possible score, [mc]. It's called a critical failure."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:379
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_648a8c45:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Y ahora viene mi pifia como DM. No le he puesto nombre al chico. *Risa* Lo tengo apuntado como"
    dap "*In the real world* And now comes my DM critical failure. *Laugh* I didn't name the guy. *Laugh* I have it listed as..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:380
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_12fef149:

    # wil "¡Ahhh!"
    wil "Ahhh!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:381
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_eadc9df6:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* ¿Puedo apuñalar al alabardero?"
    mc "*In the real world* Can I stab the halberdier?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:382
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_7236e8d9:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* No. Es el momento en que el resto hagan sus acciones. *Tira dados* Las arqueras sacan flechas de sus carcaj y te apuntan. Maddie."
    dap "*In the real world* No. It's time for the rest to take their actions. *Roll dice* The archers draw arrows from their quivers and aim at you. Maddie."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:384
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_51810fd2:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* Les digo que no hagan nada con la cabeza mientras las apunto alternativamente."
    mad "*In the real world* I tell them not to do anything with my head as I aim at them alternately."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:385
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_c2e1e6ba:

    # madd "Bajad los arcos. Puedo dispararos a ambas antes de que soltéis la segunda flecha."
    madd "Lower your bows. I can shoot you both before you release the second arrow."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:386
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_8ce7ce52:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* *Tirando dados* 18 - 1. Me parece que me creen."
    mad "*In the real world* *Rolling dice* 18 - 1. I think they believe me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:387
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_06db8b8d:

    # mad "*Risita* *Tiempo Muerto* Es una fanfarronada, pero ellas no lo saben, [mc]. Es una de las cosas buenas de esto; ni tú sabes el nivel que tienen ellos ni ellos el que tienes tú."
    mad "*Giggle* *Timeout* It's a brag, but they don't know that, [mc]. That's one of the nice things about this; neither you know what level they are, nor they know what level you are."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:388
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_2a6199e8:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* [emm]. Tu turno."
    dap "*In the real world* [emm], your turn."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:390
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_5f010bf0:

    # emm "*En el mundo real* Cargo contra Euricus, pero contengo el golpe. Me pongo delante de Euricus, en posición amenazadora."
    emm "*In the real world* I charge against Euricus, but I hold back the blow. I stand in front of him in a threatening position."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:391
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_df9375e7:

    # emmd "Dile a tu gente que baje las armas."
    emmd "Tell your people to lower their weapons."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:392
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_4f154c17:

    # emm "*En el mundo real* *Tirando dados* Carisma 20 + 3. Se ha cagado patas abajo."
    emm "*In the real world* *Rolling dice* Charisma 20 + 3. He's pooped his pants."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:393
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_7fe7167b:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Genial. [eri]."
    dap "*In the real world* Great. [eri]."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:394
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_2b9d6fcc:

    # eri "*En el mundo real* Me acerco al otro alabardero por detrás y le pongo un cuchillo en el cuello. Supongo que está distraído y tengo algún bonus. 14 + 4"
    eri "*In the real world* I approach the other halberdier from behind and put a knife to his neck. I guess he's distracted and I have some bonus. 14 + 4"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:396
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_b77fac47:

    # erid "*Susurrando* Será mejor que sueltes ese pincho. No queremos que te hagas daño. Ni quiero hacértelo yo."
    erid "*Whispering* You'd better let go of that skewer. We don't want you to get hurt. Nor do I want to hurt you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:398
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_33a0af04:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* *Tira dados* El alabardero suelta la alabarda."
    dap "*In the real world* *Rolls dice* The halberdier drops the halberd."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:400
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_b2ad77a8:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Euricus levanta las manos en señal de derrota. No le ha dado tiempo a sacar las armas."
    dap "*In the real world* Euricus raises his hands in defeat. He hasn't had time to draw his weapons."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:401
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_110325b8:

    # erkd "No hace falta luchad. Ya noz vamoz. No queremoz pdedicad en lugarez donde no zomoz bienvenidoz."
    erkd "No need to fight. We ade leaving. We don't want to pdeach in placez whede we ade not welcome."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:403
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_153aa496:

    # sold "¡No tenéis derecho a echarnos! ¡Estamos aquí para salvar vuestras almas! Os convertiréis en lemures si morís después de que una pelirroja os absorba el alma..."
    sold "You have no right to throw us out! We are here to save your souls! You will become lemurs if you die after a redhead absorbs your soul..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:405
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_0481a72b:

    # dapd "No somos malas... es que hemos nacido así. *Risa*"
    dapd "We're not bad... we're just born that way. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:406
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_24a2afa7:

    # dap "*Tiempo Muerto* *Risita* Siempre he querido hacer un homenaje a esa frase de Jessica Hare. Menos mal que no la habéis cagado."
    dap "*Timeout* *Giggle* I've always wanted to do an homage to that Jessica Hare quote. Good thing you guys didn't screw it up."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:408
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_458f65f2:

    # erkd "No le hagáiz mucho caso. No zabe aceptad una dedota ni irce cuando zobda en algún citio."
    erkd "Don't pay much attention to him. He doezn't know how to accept defeat od leave when people don't want to zee him in zome place."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:410
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_c723a236:

    # sold "¡Decanus! ¡Esa no es una conducta propia de un servidor de Marte!"
    sold "Decanus! That's not a behavior befitting a servant of Mars!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:411
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_85662239:

    # sold "¡Informaré a nuestro amado lider de tus palabras!"
    sold "I will inform our beloved leader about your words!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:413
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_85f4a80e:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Los BDSM se dirigen a las puertas en las murallas del pueblo bajo la atenta mirada de las Protectoras. Euricus y Solomon están claramente discutiendo."
    dap "*In the real world* The BDSMs head for the gates in the town walls under the watchful eye of The Protectors. Euricus and Solomon are clearly arguing."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:414
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_7f371b1a:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* No hay nadie para abrir las puertas. Parecen un poco humillados por tener que abrir las pesadas puertas ellos mismos."
    dap "*In the real world* There is no one to open the doors. They seem a bit humiliated at having to open the heavy doors themselves."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:415
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_293e81d0:

    # mc "*Tiempo Muerto* Pero las puertas estaban abiertas cuando hemos llegado con la caravana. ¿No se cerraban solo de noche?"
    mc "*Timeout* But the doors were open when we arrived with the caravan. I thought they only close at night?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:418
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_9b83cb62:

    # sca "Las ha cerrado Beagan con magia cuando hemos llegado al pueblo. Hay otros cinco BDSM fuera, cuatro alabarderos y un arquero, y no quería que intervinieran."
    sca "Beagan closed them with magic when we arrived in town. There are five other BDSMs outside, four halberdiers and an archer, and I didn't want them to interfere."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:419
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_01b082fd:

    # sca "Me he imaginado lo que estaba pasando dentro al no ir acompañados de un clérigo. Ese fue el final de nuestra última partida. [dap] siempre nos deja con ganas de más."
    sca "I imagined what was going on inside when they were not accompanied by a priest. That was the end of our last game. [dap] always leaves us wanting for more."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:421
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_7088c77b:

    # dap "El encuentro ha acabado. *Risa* Por una vez lo habéis resuelto sin tener que matar a nadie. La gente empieza a dispersarse ¿Qué hacéis?"
    dap "The encounter is over. *Laugh* For once you've resolved it without having to kill anyone. People start to disperse. What do you do?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:422
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_5e9e408b:

    # mc "Yo quiero ver cómo está el chaval que ha recibido la hostia con la alabarda."
    mc "I want to see how the kid who took the halberd hit is doing."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:425
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_89774987:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* No es un chaval, tiene unos 18."
    dap "*In the real world* He's not a kid, he's around 18."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:426
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_6e234cc4:

    # mcd "¿Cómo estás chaval?"
    mcd "How are you kiddo?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:427
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_fb9d7827:

    # wil "Bien, Señor. Ha sido muy valiente lo que ha hecho, defendiendo a las mujeres. Gracias..."
    wil "Fine, Sir. That was a very brave thing you did, standing up for the women. Thank you..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:429
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_041eeb64:

    # mcd "Marzia, ¿puedes traer algo para limpiar la herida y curarle?"
    mcd "Marzia, can you bring something to clean the wound and heal him?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:430
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_ed063487:

    # marziad "Sí, ahora mismo voy."
    marziad "Yes, I'll be right back."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:431
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_6054b5f6:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Ayudo a levantarse al chaval."
    mc "*In the real world* I help the lad up."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:433
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_32d2658c:

    # dapd "Bueno, las curaciones son mi especialidad... ni siquiera quedará cicatriz."
    dapd "Well, healing is my specialty... there won't even be a scar left."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:435
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_1ae73049:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Mmmm..."
    dap "*In the real world* Mmmm..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:436
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_e5444ac1:

    # wil "Si no le importa, Señora, preferiría el método tradicional de curación... no es que tenga nada en contra de la magia..."
    wil "If you don't mind, Ma'am, I would prefer the traditional method of healing... not that I have anything against magic..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:438
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_7dffa6e0:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Veis que dirige una fugaz mirada a Thiel, la chica gato. Retira la mirada en cuanto se da cuenta de que ella también lo está mirando."
    dap "*In the real world* You see that he directs a fleeting glance at Thiel, the cat girl. He withdraws his gaze as soon as he realizes she's looking at him too."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:440
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_ec60c81e:

    # wil "*Susurrando* A las chicas les gustan las cicatrices, ¿verdad?"
    wil "*Whispering* Girls like scars, don't they?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:441
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_29de2ce0:

    # mcd "*Susurrando* *Risa* Sí, muchacho, les gustan."
    mcd "*Whispering* *Laugh* Yes, lad, they like them."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:442
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_3d46c2af:

    # wil "Además, servirá de recordatorio de cuando echasteis a los BDSM del pueblo."
    wil "Besides, it will serve as a reminder of when you ran the BDSMs out of town."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:444
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_66c1b378:

    # mcd "¿Quieres ser legionario? En el ejército conseguirás muchas más cicatrices."
    mcd " Do you want to be a legionnaire? In the army you'll get a lot more scars."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:445
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_35310ff0:

    # wil "No, señor, solo quiero ayudar a mi madre y a mis hermanas en la granja. Faltan hombres en este pueblo."
    wil "Oh, no, sir! I just want to help my mother and sisters at the farm. There is a lack of men in this village."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:447
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_c0c07de9:

    # madd "Vilfredo, deberíamos partir hacia Vindobona o se nos hará de noche en el camino."
    madd "Vilfredo, we should leave for Vindobona, or it will get dark before we arrive."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:448
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_df1e9df9:

    # mcd "Perfecto, vamos a los establos a coger los caballos y nos vamos."
    mcd "Great! Let's go to the stables to get the horses and leave."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:450
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_4f1e2e45:

    # marziad "No sabéis lo lejos que está Vindobona, ¿verdad? No llegaréis allí antes de que se ponga el sol y cierren las puertas. Son unas seis horas cabalgando."
    marziad "You don't know how far Vindobona is, do you? You won't get there before the sun sets and they close the gates. It's about six hours riding."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:451
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_415c511f:

    # marziad "A menos que queráis reventar los caballos."
    marziad "Unless you want to break your horses."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:452
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_fd6fa2be:

    # marziad "Pero podéis dormir en la posada hoy y partir mañana por la mañana. Las habitaciones corren de mi cuenta."
    marziad "But you can sleep at the inn today and leave tomorrow morning. The rooms are on me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:453
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_1bd64734:

    # mcd "Gracias, ¿que te parece, Madd... digo... Fang?"
    mcd "Thanks, what do you think, Madd... I mean... Fang?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:455
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_69ece20b:

    # madd "No es mala idea. Muchas gracias, Marzia."
    madd "Not a bad idea. Thank you very much, Marzia."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:457
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_767bdf9b:

    # scad "Dejadnos invitaros a una cerveza."
    scad "Let us buy you guys a beer."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:458
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_0eced789:

    # mcd "Eso lo podemos aceptar sin problema."
    mcd "We can accept that without a doubt, as well."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:459
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_254ca1bc:

    # mcd "Pero antes..."
    mcd "But first..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:464
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_b840ce13:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Le lanzo una moneda al chaval. Se lo ha ganado, al menos por la cicatriz que llevará de por vida por mi culpa."
    mc "*In the real world* I flip the kid a coin. He's earned it, at least for the scar he'll carry for life because of me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:465
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_dbfc8210:

    # mc "*Risa* *Tiempo Muerto* Me siento culpable por un personaje que no tiene nombre siquiera."
    mc "*Laugh* *Timeout* I feel guilty for a character that doesn't even have a name."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:468
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_9ad9220b:

    # wil "¡Oh! ¡Gracias, Señor!"
    wil "Oh! Thank you, Sir!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:469
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_2ac72756:

    # mcd "Te lo has ganado, muchacho. Siempre hay que defender a los más débiles."
    mcd "You've earned it, kid. You always have to stand up for the weaker ones."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:470
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_bc839fba:

    # eri "*Risa* *Tiempo Muerto* Te recuerdo que Vilfredo es tu personaje, no eres tú."
    eri "*Laugh* *Timeout* I remind you that Vilfredo is your character, he's not you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:471
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_e5d9a00e:

    # emm "*Risa* *Tiempo Muerto* Y no eres un caballero, eres un pícaro."
    emm "*Laugh* *Timeout* And you're not a knight, you're a Rogue."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:472
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_2f200d33:

    # mc "*Risa* *Tiempo Muerto* Lo sé, pero lo diseñé como un defensor de las damas. Y el chaval apunta maneras."
    mc "*Laugh* *Timeout* I know, but I designed him as a ladies' advocate. And the kid is showing potential."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:474
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_568f4af6:

    # wil "¡Lo haré! ¡Guardaré su moneda como recordatorio!"
    wil "I will! I'll keep your coin as a reminder!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:475
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_8827f526:

    # mcd "Hazlo muchacho."
    mcd "Do it, lad."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:476
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_dbd64d5c:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Ya nos podemos ir a tomar esa cerveza, paga..."
    mc "*In the real world* We can go drink that beer now, ..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:478
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_cff94b70:

    # mc "Beagan."
    mc "Beagan is paying."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:479
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_fc8ce2f4:

    # mc "¡Vaya! Yo estaba contentísimo con el dibujo que había hecho [emm] de mi personaje... ¡Pero el tuyo es espectacular!"
    mc "Wow! I was really happy with the drawing [emm] did for my character... But yours is spectacular!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:480
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_409e7b48:

    # sca "Todos los ha dibujado [emm]. Es nuestra artista residente."
    sca "They've all been drawn by [emm]. She's our resident artist."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:481
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_0f5ba71d:

    # mc "¿Me dejáis ver los vuestros, chicas?"
    mc "May I see yours, girls?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:483
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_2dd13a86:

    # "El resto de las chicas te pasan sus hojas de personaje para que admires las obras de arte de [emm]."
    "The rest of the girls hand you their character sheets so you can admire [emm]'s artwork."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:484
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_1b1b54f6:

    # mc "Son alucinantes, [emm]."
    mc "They are mind-blowing, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:485
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_3b09027f:

    # emm "Gracias..."
    emm "Thanks..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:486
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_519bb7ed:

    # mc "Pero tengo una pregunta... Tú y [eri] os apellidáis igual... ¿Casualidad?"
    mc "But I have a question... You and [eri] have the same last name? Coincidence?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:488
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_e15f5e44:

    # eri "*Risa* No, no es casualidad. Forma parte de la historia de nuestros personajes. ¿Se lo explicamos o es demasiado pronto?"
    eri "*Laugh* No, it's not a coincidence. It's part of our characters' backstory. Shall we explain it to him, or is it too soon?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:490
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_fab7e5be:

    # emm "Te lo podemos explicar, pero recuerda que tú lo sabes, pero tu personaje no. Somos hermanas de madre."
    emm "We can explain it to you, but remember that you know it, but your character does not. We are sisters from the same mother."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:491
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_db9691d5:

    # emm "Nuestra madre tenía... ¿cómo decirlo?... Una moral distraída... *Risa*"
    emm "Our mother had... how should I put it... An absentminded morality... *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:493
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_eee87586:

    # eri "Básicamente, se follaba a cualquier criatura mágica que pudiera encontrar. Primero se folló al padre del personaje [emm], un Ángel, y nació Paula."
    eri "Basically, she fucked any magical creature she could find. First, she fucked [emm]'s character's father, an Angel, and Paula was born."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:494
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_5744a133:

    # eri "Un año después conoció un Diablo. Y también acabaron en la cama. Y nueve meses después apareció Aelia. Livia es el nombre de la familia de nuestra madre."
    eri "A year later she met a Devil. And they also ended up in bed. And, nine months later, Aelia showed up. Livia is the name of our mother's family."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:495
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_d323ed1d:

    # mc "*Risa* Una mujer interesante, la Señora Livia. ¿Alguna más que tenga una historia divertida?"
    mc "*Laugh* An interesting woman, Mistress Livia. Anyone else who has a funny backstory?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:497
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_22e15ff7:

    # dap "*Risa* ¡A mí no me mires! Yo soy normal, o más o menos. Como tú."
    dap "*Laugh* Don't look at me! I'm normal, more or less. Just like you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:498
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_24ee1f67:

    # dap "Durante las Guerras Enanas, hace unos 150 años, una antepasada mía intimó, no sabemos si voluntariamente o no, con un elfo bajo el sol de Tarraco."
    dap "During the Dwarf Wars, about 150 years ago, an ancestress of mine was intimate, we don't know whether willingly or not, with an elf under the sun of Tarraco."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:499
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_c14b16dc:

    # dap "La sangre élfica nunca desaparece del todo."
    dap "Elvish blood never quite disappears."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:501
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_dcd418c8:

    # sca "Lo mío es más sencillo. Soy de Hibernia (Irlanda). Las Hadas conquistaron las Islas Británicas mientras los Romanos se pegaban, y perdían, con los Elfos en la Galia."
    sca "Mine is simpler. I'm from Hibernia (Ireland). The Fairies conquered the British Isles while the Romans were fighting, and losing, to the Elves in Gaul."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:502
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_aee1bcb3:

    # sca "Estoy en el continente en... una misión que sólo [dap] conoce."
    sca "I am on the mainland on... a quest that only [dap] knows about."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:504
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_c99fb6ec:

    # mc "¿Y tu, Maddie? Tu personaje es asiática, pero te apellidas Josephus. Es raro, ¿no?"
    mc "What about you, Maddie? Your character is Asian, but your last name is Josephus. That's weird, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:505
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_905d12b1:

    # mad "Bueno, mis abuelos llegaron a Siria huyendo de las criaturas que habitan en Asia Oriental hace 60 años. Cambiaron su apellido cuando llegaron, como casi todos los refugiados."
    mad "Well, my grandparents came to Syria fleeing the creatures inhabiting East Asia 60 years ago. They changed their last name when they arrived, like almost all refugees."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:506
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_840c3481:

    # mad "Pero seguimos manteniendo las costumbres de nuestra patria, Wu, como puedes ver por mi nombre."
    mad "But we still uphold the customs of our homeland, Wu, as you can see by my name."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:507
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_c19869ad:

    # mc "Oh, genial. Todas tenéis una historia chula... Yo... soy un Semielfo cuya antepasada fue violada por un Drow. Fin de la historia. *Risa*"
    mc "Oh, great. You all have a cool story... I am a half-elf whose ancestor was raped by a Drow. End of the story. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:509
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_ff44df6b:

    # dap "Eso se aprende tal como vayas jugando más. Conocerás el mundo y podrás añadir cosas a la historia de tu próximo personaje."
    dap "You learn that as you play more, you'll get to know the world and you'll be able to add things to your next character's background."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:511
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_98091b0d:

    # sca "Además, jugar con un personaje que es una hoja en blanco puede ser muy divertido. No estás atado por un pasado y puedes escribir tu futuro."
    sca " Moreover, playing with a character that is a blank sheet can be a lot of fun. You're not bound by a past and you can write your future."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:512
translate english c20s001_NovumTemplum_ccdbb7d6:

    # sca "¿Seguimos? Se está haciendo tarde..."
    sca "Shall we go on? It's getting late..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:527
translate english c20s002_Tavern_ccb59c18:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Volvéis a la taberna donde Marzia os sirve unas cervezas."
    dap "*In the real world* You return to the tavern, where Marzia serves you some beers."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:528
translate english c20s002_Tavern_73989d48:

    # marziad "Beagan, las apunto en tu cuenta, ¿no?"
    marziad "Beagan, I put them on your tab, right?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:530
translate english c20s002_Tavern_562a2ff7:

    # scad "Esta ronda, sí."
    scad "Yes, but only this round."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:532
translate english c20s002_Tavern_8e959f12:

    # scad "Ahora mejor. *Risa*"
    scad "Now that's better. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:533
translate english c20s002_Tavern_e1b7e9f3:

    # mcd "¿Por qué te has reducido? ¿Lo de tener tamaño humano tiene duración?"
    mcd "Why did you shrink? Does the human-size thing have a max duration?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:535
translate english c20s002_Tavern_94843924:

    # scad "No, que va. Es por una razón mucho más sencilla. La cerveza no cambia de tamaño, pero me dura más. *Risa* Les ahorro unas monedas a mis compañeras."
    scad "No, it's not that. It's for a much simpler reason. The beer doesn't change size, but it lasts me longer. *Laugh* I save my companions a few coins."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:537
translate english c20s002_Tavern_5078c710:

    # dapd "No voy a decir que sea una borracha, pero... Beagan es muy considerada con nosotras aunque time a Marzia."
    dapd "I'm not going to say she's a drunk, but... Beagan is very considerate of us even though she's scamming Marzia."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:539
translate english c20s002_Tavern_d2a74ecf:

    # emmd "Técnicamente no es un timo. Marzia sirve una cerveza y cobra una cerveza. Si Beagan consigue pasar la tarde con una sola cerveza no es un timo."
    emmd "Technically it's not a scam. Marzia pours a beer and charges for a beer. If Beagan gets through the evening with just one beer it's not a con."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:540
translate english c20s002_Tavern_bd76ad3d:

    # emmd "Si pensara que está timando a Marzia no le permitiría hacerlo."
    emmd "If I thought she was scamming Marzia, I wouldn't let her do it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:542
translate english c20s002_Tavern_c54d2188:

    # erid "¿Y qué ibas a hacer para evitarlo?"
    erid "And what would you do to prevent it?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:544
translate english c20s002_Tavern_6b1859cd:

    # scad "Seguro que Paula pediría una cerveza para mí en cada ronda, aunque no pudiera bebérmela."
    scad "I'm sure Paula would order a beer for me on every round, even if I couldn't drink it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:545
translate english c20s002_Tavern_11b6ca7a:

    # scad "Y no se la dejaría beber a nadie. Ya sabéis que los Paladines no saben divertirse y a veces no dejan divertirse a los demás."
    scad "And she wouldn't let anyone drink it. You know how Paladins don't know how to have fun, and sometimes they don't let others have fun."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:547
translate english c20s002_Tavern_cd47674d:

    # emmd "Exacto... Pero estamos descuidando a nuestros invitados"
    emmd "Exactly... But we are neglecting our guests."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:548
translate english c20s002_Tavern_f6bd7151:

    # mcd "No te preocupes por nosotros. Me parece muy inteligente lo que ha hecho Beagan."
    mcd "Don't worry about us. I think what Beagan did is very smart."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:550
translate english c20s002_Tavern_66169ca5:

    # emmd "No, no, explicadnos qué hacéis en Novum Templum o se pasarán la tarde metiéndose conmigo. Y mis votos me impiden aplastarles la cara."
    emmd "No, no, explain to us what you're doing at Novum Templum, or they'll spend the afternoon picking on me. And my vows prevent me from smashing their faces."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:551
translate english c20s002_Tavern_6f7e8ae5:

    # emmd "{b}Teóricamente{/b} son mis amigas..."
    emmd "{b}Theoretically{/b} they are my friends..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:553
translate english c20s002_Tavern_fe8f5f3f:

    # madd "Nos contrataron como guardias de una caravana en... *Maddie consulta sus notas* Aquileia para ir a Vindobona, parando en algunos pueblos mineros en la ruta de las montañas."
    madd "We were hired as guards for a caravan in... *Maddie consults her notes* Aquileia to go to Vindobona, stopping at some mining towns on the mountain route."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:554
translate english c20s002_Tavern_319931f8:

    # madd "Cuando hemos llegado a Novum Templum, Marius, el jefe de la caravana, nos ha despedido porque había una cohorte que seguía el mismo camino y ya no nos necesitaban."
    madd "When we arrived at Novum Templum, Marius, the caravan leader, dismissed us because there was an army cohort following the same road and we were no longer needed."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:555
translate english c20s002_Tavern_cee93567:

    # mcd "Hemos intentado encontrar alguna caravana que vuelva a Italia, pero no hay nada aquí. Después de un mes viajando por las montañas, nos quedamos tirados al salir de ellas."
    mcd "We have been trying to find a caravan going back to Italy, but there is nothing here. After a month of traveling through the mountains, we got stranded coming out of them."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:557
translate english c20s002_Tavern_7ba1deed:

    # dapd "Seguramente tengáis más suerte en Vindobona. Por norma las caravanas van por la ruta del este. Sólo las caravanas mineras cruzan las montañas."
    dapd "You will probably have better luck in Vindobona. As a rule, caravans go by the eastern route. Only mining caravans cross the mountains."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:558
translate english c20s002_Tavern_a6e447c1:

    # mcd "Por eso nos iremos mañana. Aquí no hay trabajo para nosotros."
    mcd "That's why we're leaving tomorrow. There's no work for us here."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:560
translate english c20s002_Tavern_0e5e1f55:

    # erid "Si alguna vez volvéis a pasar por aquí, no dudéis en visitarnos. No ha estado mal que hayáis intentado defender a Marzia y a Thiel."
    erid "If you ever stop by again, don't hesitate to visit us. It wasn't bad of you to try to defend Marzia and Thiel."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:561
translate english c20s002_Tavern_7504b3df:

    # erid "Incluso sin conocerlas de nada."
    erid "More so without knowing them at all."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:563
translate english c20s002_Tavern_83dee3e1:

    # madd "Yo sé de lo que son capaces los BDSM. Y Júpiter también. Defender a alguien de esa escoria es un placer."
    madd "I know what BDSMs are capable of. And so does Jupiter. Defending someone from that scum is a pleasure."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:564
translate english c20s002_Tavern_f3bf79fc:

    # "Maddie explica lo de la menagerie de Capua otra vez."
    "Maddie explains the story about the Capua menagerie again."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:567
translate english c20s002_Tavern_ddff7acb:

    # mc "Espera, eso ya lo has explicado, ¿no?"
    mc "Wait, you already explained that, didn't you?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:568
translate english c20s002_Tavern_3bd62d4d:

    # mad "Sí, pero los personajes de ellas no estaban en la taberna. Aunque ellas estuvieran aquí por comodidad de todos, van a pretender que no lo saben si no lo explico con sus personajes presentes."
    mad "Yes, but their characters were not in the tavern. Even if they were here in the kitchen for everyone's convenience, they're going to pretend they don't know if I don't explain it with their characters present."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:569
translate english c20s002_Tavern_de73e631:

    # mad "Hay algunos DMs, la mayoría, que hacen salir a los jugadores de la habitación cuando sus personajes no están."
    mad "There are some DMs, most of them, who have players leave the room when their characters are away."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:571
translate english c20s002_Tavern_71a03bd9:

    # dap "Yo lo hago, pero solo cuando es imprescindible y puede afectar a otras acciones simultáneas. Depende del tipo de escena o lo que vaya a durar, puede ser aburrido para las que están esperando."
    dap "I do it, but only when it is essential and may affect other simultaneous actions. It depends on the type of scene or how long it's going to last, it can be boring for those waiting."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:572
translate english c20s002_Tavern_ca29b504:

    # dap "Tenemos un pacto entre damas para no usar lo que nuestros personajes no saben, como lo que te han dicho [eri] y [emm] de la madre de sus personajes."
    dap "We have a ladies‘ pact not to use what our characters don't know, like what [eri] and [emm] told you about their characters’ mother."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:573
translate english c20s002_Tavern_a0ae555c:

    # mc "Ah, vale lo entiendo, mejor así. Si me mandas solo al salón, no te aseguro que no me quede dormido en el sofá. *Risa*"
    mc "Ah, okay, I understand, it's better that way. If you send me alone to the living room, I can't assure you that I won't fall asleep on the couch. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:576
translate english c20s002_Tavern_7e9fb35a:

    # dapd "Nosotras nos cruzamos con ese clérigo hace una semana. Estaba predicando en un pueblo minero a un par de días de aquí al que fuimos a ayudar... en un asunto."
    dapd "We came across that Cleric about a week ago. He was preaching in a mining town a couple of days from here that we went to help... on a matter."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:577
translate english c20s002_Tavern_99f2aa69:

    # dapd "Allí todo el mundo es humano y no hay pelirrojas, con lo que no amenazó con quemar a nadie."
    dapd "Everyone there is human and there are no redheads, so he didn't threaten to burn anyone."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:579
translate english c20s002_Tavern_4846b105:

    # erid "Pero vimos cómo se las gastaba cuando nos vio. Es un fanático de esos que quieren exterminar a todas las razas del mundo y que vuelva a se totalmente humano, como dicen que era antaño."
    erid "But we saw what he was like when he saw us. He's one of those fanatics who want to exterminate all the races of the world and go back to being fully human, as they say it once was."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:581
translate english c20s002_Tavern_0fd2bd75:

    # emmd "Para hacer eso se necesitarían siglos de guerras, y él es un clérigo de Marte, el dios de la guerra, con lo que su dios estaría contento."
    emmd "To do that would take centuries of wars, and he is a Cleric of Mars, the god of war, so his god would be happy with it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:582
translate english c20s002_Tavern_ac94b9aa:

    # emmd "Hay muchos como él dando vueltas por las fronteras del Imperio, provocando a la gente para que presionen a los gobernadores de las provincias fronterizas."
    emmd "There are many like him going around the borders of the Empire, provoking people to put pressure on the governors of the border provinces."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:583
translate english c20s002_Tavern_04c9a352:

    # emmd "Y la gente no es muy lista. Sólo quieren que su vecino Elfo se vaya al infierno. No ven las vidas inocentes que eso costaría."
    emmd "And people aren't very smart. They just want their Elf neighbor to go to hell. They don't see the innocent lives that would cost."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:584
translate english c20s002_Tavern_0499ce09:

    # mcd "Eso es mezquino..."
    mcd "That's small-minded... to say the least."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:586
translate english c20s002_Tavern_98d752d2:

    # scad "Sí, pero llevamos demasiados siglos de paz para el gusto de Marte y otros dioses de la guerra."
    scad "Yes, but we have had too many decades of peace for the liking of Mars and the other gods of war."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:587
translate english c20s002_Tavern_41b8a291:

    # scad "En Las Islas, los clérigos de nuestros dioses de la guerra llevan décadas queriendo invadir la Galia."
    scad "In The Isles, the Clerics of our war gods have been wanting to invade Gaul for decades."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:588
translate english c20s002_Tavern_23e03859:

    # mcd "Pero eso es territorio Enano. ¿Entraríais en guerra con ellos?"
    mcd "But that's Dwarven territory. Would you go to war with them?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:590
translate english c20s002_Tavern_cdd00628:

    # scad "Los Enanos están al Este y al Sur de la Galia, nuestros clérigos quieren invadir las cuencas del Sequana (Sena) y del Liger (Loira), donde solo viven humanos."
    scad "The Dwarves are to the East and South of Gaul, our Clerics want to invade the basins of the Sequana (Seine) and the Liger (Loire), where only humans live."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:591
translate english c20s002_Tavern_4f6f9c50:

    # scad "Aunque pertenezcan a los Reinos Enanos, sólo son granjeros, casi esclavos. Los clérigos dicen que los \"liberaríamos\". En realidad pasarían a ser nuestros esclavos."
    scad "Although they belong to the Dwarven Kingdoms, they are only farmers, almost slaves. The Clerics say we would \"liberate\" them. In reality, they would become our slaves."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:592
translate english c20s002_Tavern_fc61cf00:

    # mcd "Pero si los Enanos salen de sus montañas..."
    mcd "But if the Dwarves come out of their mountains..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:594
translate english c20s002_Tavern_d825677e:

    # scad "Siempre dicen que ¿qué es lo peor que nos puede pasar? Nos podrían hacer retroceder hasta el mar. Volveríamos a nuestras Islas y ya está."
    scad "They always say - \"what's the worst that can happen to us?\" Well, we would be driven back out to sea if that happened. We'd go back to our Islands and that's it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:595
translate english c20s002_Tavern_3c869d1e:

    # scad "No es que los Enanos vayan a hacer un tunel uniendo Britania y la Galia. *Risa* ¡Eso no se puede hacer!"
    scad "It's not like the Dwarves are going to make a tunnel linking Britannia and Gaul. *Laugh* That can't be done!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:596
translate english c20s002_Tavern_fc2b8476:

    # scad "Por suerte para nosotros, nadie hace caso de los clérigos de los dioses de la guerra. Ni a nuestros reyes, siquiera. Somos demasiado independientes para eso."
    scad "Fortunately for us, no one pays any attention to the Clerics of the gods of war. Not even to our kings. We're too independent for that."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:598
translate english c20s002_Tavern_6f53f4a2:

    # madd "¿Y entre los Enanos y los Elfos? ¿Sabéis si sus dioses también están promoviendo la guerra?"
    madd "What about among the Dwarves and Elves, do you know if their gods are also promoting war?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:600
translate english c20s002_Tavern_abd66dc0:

    # dapd "Los Enanos no lo necesitan. Están en guerra permanente entre ellos. Además, los Reinos de Carpathia y los de Caucasia están en una guerra defensiva con las hordas del Este."
    dapd "The Dwarves don't need it. They are at permanent war with each other. Besides, the Kingdoms of Carpathia and those of Caucasia are in a defensive war against the Eastern hordes."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:601
translate english c20s002_Tavern_fb497ad5:

    # dapd "Los que quieren guerrear se van allí. Si no fuera por ellos, seguramente el Imperio estaría lleno de criaturas con la piel verde."
    dapd "Those who want to go to war, go to those kingdoms. If it weren't for them, surely the Empire would be full of green-skinned creatures."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:603
translate english c20s002_Tavern_16363bb8:

    # emmd "Y los Elfos llevan más de cien años queriendo recuperar Hispania pero, sin el apoyo del Emperador, no tienen nada que hacer."
    emmd "And the Elves have been wanting to take back Hispania for over a hundred years but, without the Emperor's support, it would be impossible."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:604
translate english c20s002_Tavern_2e99e15b:

    # emmd "Pero viven más que las hadas, con lo que tienen paciencia. Casi todos ellos recuerdan aún cuando vivían allí y esperan que los Reinos Enanos se maten entre ellos."
    emmd "But they live longer than Fairies, so they have patience. Almost all of them still remember when they lived there and expect the Dwarf Kingdoms to kill each other."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:606
translate english c20s002_Tavern_d2432a94:

    # erid "Entonces podrán volver y reinar sobre las ruinas. Muy élfico. Van de pacíficos comedores de flores, pero son unos rastreros que conspiran por la espalda."
    erid "Then they can come back and reign over the ruins. Very elvish. They pretend to be peaceful flower eaters, but they're backstabbing crawlers who plot behind everyone's back."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:607
translate english c20s002_Tavern_be5ec78d:

    # erid "Estoy segura de que tienen agentes promoviendo la guerra entre el Reino de los Pirineos y... ¿yo que sé?... no me sé el nombre de todos los Reinos Enanos."
    erid "I'm sure they have agents promoting the war between the Kingdom of the Pyrenees and... what do I know?... I don't know the names of all the Dwarven Kingdoms."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:608
translate english c20s002_Tavern_b313d472:

    # erid "A veces parece que hay uno debajo de cada puta colina del mundo."
    erid "Sometimes it seems like there's one under every fucking hill in the world."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:610
translate english c20s002_Tavern_cc878dc0:

    # scad "Si no recuerdo mal... *Hic* hay ocho o nueve reinos solo en Hispania. Pero lucharían como uno solo si alguien fuera a invadirlos."
    scad "If I remember correctly... *Hic* there are eight or nine kingdoms in Hispania alone. But they would fight as one if someone were to invade them."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:611
translate english c20s002_Tavern_d8b10f62:

    # scad "Los que lucharon en La Conquista de Hispania ahora son los que dirigen el cotarro. *Hic*"
    scad "Those who fought in The Conquest of Hispania are now the ones running the show. *Hic*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:612
translate english c20s002_Tavern_a2801d4f:

    # mcd "Es decir, los Enanos peleando, los Elfos conspirando y los clérigos de Humanos y Hadas promoviendo la guerra... casi se puede ver un patrón, ¿no?"
    mcd "I mean, the Dwarves fighting, the Elves plotting, and the Human and Fairy Clerics promoting war... you can almost see a pattern, can't you?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:614
translate english c20s002_Tavern_72fd7c2e:

    # madd "Desde luego, lo parece. Que los Elfos conspiren y que los Enanos peleen es normal. Pero si sumamos el resto..."
    madd "It certainly seems so. Elves plotting and Dwarves fighting is normal. But if we add the rest..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:615
translate english c20s002_Tavern_01f0ab50:

    # madd "Parece que los dioses están jugando un juego en el que somos los peones."
    madd "It seems that the gods are playing a game in which we are their pawns."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:616
translate english c20s002_Tavern_40655e5b:

    # mcd "Lo que suele ser habitual..."
    mcd "So, business as usual..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:618
translate english c20s002_Tavern_4516f5cb:

    # dapd "¿Pedimos algo para cenar? Tanto charlar me está dando hambre."
    dapd "Shall we order some dinner? All this talking is making me hungry."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:620
translate english c20s002_Tavern_abcbad1c:

    # scad "Para mí no pidas nada. *Hic* Cogeré un trozo de lo tuyo... y ahora las monedas me las ahorro yo. *Risita*"
    scad " Don't order anything for me. *Hic* I'll take a piece from yours... and now I'm the one saving some coins. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:621
translate english c20s002_Tavern_a5afc0cb:

    # mcd "Me parece una buena idea pedir la cena. Ha sido un día largo y mañana tenemos una larga cabalgata."
    mcd "I think it's a good idea to order an early dinner. It's been a long day, and we have a long ride tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:623
translate english c20s002_Tavern_39f920b1:

    # "Después de pedir la cena y que Marzia os la traiga..."
    "After ordering dinner and Marzia delivering it to your table..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:624
translate english c20s002_Tavern_96036c7a:

    # emmd "Y a vosotros... ¿no os interesaría estableceros aquí?"
    emmd "And you... wouldn't you be interested in settling here?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:625
translate english c20s002_Tavern_a24149b1:

    # emmd "Siempre van bien más manos... y armas... para defender los asentamientos de las montañas..."
    emmd "More hands... and weapons... are always welcome to defend the mountain settlements..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:627
translate english c20s002_Tavern_3ead04ca:

    # madd "Yo, al menos, no tengo intención todavía de sentar la cabeza y establecerme en un sitio fijo. Hay mucho mundo que recorrer. Por eso me hice guardia de caravanas."
    madd "I, at least, have no intention yet of settling down and establishing myself in a fixed place. There's still a lot of the world to travel and see. That's why I became a caravan guard."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:628
translate english c20s002_Tavern_0af78d83:

    # mcd "A mí no me importaría establecerme algún día en algún sitio, pero creo que es pronto todavía."
    mcd "I wouldn't mind settling down somewhere someday, but I think it's still too early."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:629
translate english c20s002_Tavern_a9cfc7a5:

    # madd "Tengo una duda... Os han llamado Las Protectoras... ¿A qué se debe?"
    madd "I have a question... You have been called The Protectors... Why is that?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:631
translate english c20s002_Tavern_0dde7196:

    # dapd "A una combinación de estar en el lugar adecuado en el momento adecuado. Hace ocho años, una partida de Bárbaros del Norte atacaron el pueblo."
    dapd "A combination of being in the right place at the right time. Eight years ago, a party of Northern Barbarians attacked the town."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:632
translate english c20s002_Tavern_b4c48d8b:

    # dapd "Nunca hemos sabido cómo evitaron las patrullas la frontera. Pero era una partida pequeña, unos 20."
    dapd "We never knew how they avoided the patrols at the border. But it was a small party, about 20."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:633
translate english c20s002_Tavern_b1f3f648:

    # dapd "Asaltaron los muros por la noche y quemaron el templo élfico de la plaza. Dicen que era bonito. No tocaron ningún otro edificio."
    dapd "They stormed the walls at night and burned the Elvish temple in the forum. They say it was beautiful. They didn't touch any other buildings."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:634
translate english c20s002_Tavern_3ac96b1d:

    # dapd "Mataron a casi todos los hombres que intentaron defender el pueblo y se llevaron a casi todas las mujeres."
    dapd "They killed almost all the men who tried to defend the village and took almost all the women."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:636
translate english c20s002_Tavern_2a682645:

    # scad "Nosotras llegamos un par de días después, íbamos de paso... *Hic* a alguna parte."
    scad "We arrived a couple of days later, we were passing through... *Hic* on our way to somewhere."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:637
translate english c20s002_Tavern_c2ea5f94:

    # scad "Seguimos a la partida durante una semana, en los que iban dejando un rastro de destrucción."
    scad "We followed that party for a week, in which they were leaving a trail of destruction."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:638
translate english c20s002_Tavern_4845f073:

    # scad "Cuando los alcanzamos sólo quedaban unos 15 y llevaban más de 40 mujeres cautivas y varios niños, como Thiel, que no era de aquí, y el chico que se ha llevado el golpe de alabarda."
    scad "When we caught up with them there were only about 15 left and they were holding more than 40 women and several children captive, like Thiel, who was not from here, and the boy who has taken the halberd blow."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:640
translate english c20s002_Tavern_234b8dc3:

    # emmd "No podíamos dejar que se las llevaran, con lo que atacamos su campamento una noche y matamos a unos cuantos. El resto salió huyendo."
    emmd "We couldn't let them take the women and children, so we attacked their camp at night and killed a few of them. The rest ran away."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:641
translate english c20s002_Tavern_4e262fa2:

    # emmd "Aunque fuera poco honorable, era necesario por un bien mayor."
    emmd "Even if it was less than honorable, it was necessary for the greater good."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:643
translate english c20s002_Tavern_aa00267f:

    # erid "Rescatamos a las mujeres y las trajimos aquí. La mayoría era de Novum Templum al fin y al cabo."
    erid "We rescued the women and brought them here. Most of them were from Novum Templum, after all."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:644
translate english c20s002_Tavern_92285924:

    # erid "Había algunas que no eran de aquí, como Thiel. Era un cachorrito negro monísimo por entonces. *Risa*"
    erid "Some of them weren't from here, like Thiel. She was a cute little black kitten back then. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:646
translate english c20s002_Tavern_466e6166:

    # scad "¡Eso es racista!"
    scad "That's racist!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:648
translate english c20s002_Tavern_316d8cb4:

    # erid "No lo es. *Risa* Somos las únicas del pueblo que tenemos adornos en la cabeza. Sabes que adoro a la chica."
    erid "No, it's not. *Laugh* We're the only ones in town with head ornaments. You know I absolutely love the girl."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:650
translate english c20s002_Tavern_5a46d185:

    # erid "Nos ofrecieron una de las casas que habían quedado vacías, pero no podíamos aceptarlo, no pensábamos quedarnos."
    erid "They offered us one of the houses that had been left empty, but we couldn't accept it, we weren't planning on staying."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:652
translate english c20s002_Tavern_ff55a27c:

    # emmd "Marzia nos ofreció entonces habitaciones en la posada. Las aceptamos por un par de semanas y ya llevamos ocho años aquí..."
    emmd "Marzia then offered us rooms at the inn. We accepted them for a couple of weeks, and we've been here for eight years now..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:653
translate english c20s002_Tavern_9e235f8f:

    # mc "*Tiempo Muerto* Espera... ¿Ocho años? ¿Qué edades tienen vuestros personajes?"
    mc "*Timeout* Wait... Eight years? How old are your characters?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:656
translate english c20s002_Tavern_889186d9:

    # emm "Paula tiene 29 y Aelia, [eri], tiene 27. No soy muy buena dibujando chicas más adultas. Todas me salen muy jóvenes."
    emm "Paula is 29 and Aelia, [eri], is 27. I'm not very good at drawing older girls. They all come out very young for my taste."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:658
translate english c20s002_Tavern_c61e540e:

    # dap "Pia tiene 43 pero aparenta 30 y pocos. Piensa que, en esos 8 años, casi no hemos salido de aventuras. Hemos ayudado a reconstruir el pueblo y poco más."
    dap "Pia is 43, but she looks like she's in her early 30s. Just think, in those 8 years, we've hardly gone on any adventures. We've helped rebuild the village and little else."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:659
translate english c20s002_Tavern_f13a435f:

    # sca "Beagan aparenta 31 años humanos... 126 años reales."
    sca "Beagan appears to be 31 human years old... But she's 126 actual years."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:660
translate english c20s002_Tavern_4d153644:

    # sca "La edad de Beagan puede salir en la conversación y hacer como que lo sabes. Todo el mundo sabe que las hadas envejecen lento."
    sca "Beagan's age can come up in conversation and pretend you know it. Everyone knows that Fae age slowly."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:661
translate english c20s002_Tavern_068fcec2:

    # mc "¡Joder! Yo os imaginaba como sois ahora... Vilfredo tiene 21, soy el más joven, ¿no?"
    mc "Fuck! I imagined you guys as you are now... Vilfredo is 21, I'm the youngest, right?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:663
translate english c20s002_Tavern_e9e60f7e:

    # mad "Conmigo lo has acertado. Fang tiene mi edad. Pero no hace falta que las imagines más viejas. Cómo ves tú a los personajes en tu mente sólo depende de ti."
    mad "You got it right with me. Fang is my age. But you don't need to picture them older. How you see the characters in your mind is only up to you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:664
translate english c20s002_Tavern_3f87503f:

    # mcp "(Como ha pasado con vuestras armaduras o con Júpiter, claro. Es más fácil seguir imaginándoos tal y como sois.)"
    mcp "(As has happened with your armor or with Jupiter, of course. It's easier to keep imagining you as you are.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:665
translate english c20s002_Tavern_f9a578f6:

    # mc "Ok, ¿seguimos? El mundo me está pareciendo super interesante."
    mc "Ok, shall we continue? The world is looking super interesting to me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:668
translate english c20s002_Tavern_04c367e2:

    # emmd "Como te decía, nos ofrecieron habitaciones. Desde entonces hemos ayudado a las mujeres del pueblo a recuperarse. Pero faltan hombres. Muchos hombres."
    emmd "As I was saying, they offered us rooms. Since then, we have helped the women in the village to recover. But there is a lack of men. A lot of men."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:669
translate english c20s002_Tavern_555aca48:

    # emmd "Somos más de 50 mujeres y sólo hay once hombres. Y la mayoría eran niños hace 8 años."
    emmd "There are more than 50 women and there are only eleven men. And most of them were children eight years ago."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:670
translate english c20s002_Tavern_da4f423e:

    # mcd "Eso podría ser tentador para más de un hombre..."
    mcd "That might be tempting to more than one man..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:672
translate english c20s002_Tavern_06ad3311:

    # dapd "El Consejo de Mujeres incluso aprobó una ley para que un hombre pudiera vivir con más de una mujer, pero eso no ha atraído a muchos. Solo a un forastero."
    dapd "The Women's Council even passed a law so that a man could live with more than one woman, but that hasn't attracted that many. Only one outsider."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:673
translate english c20s002_Tavern_e5c85f06:

    # dapd "Se marchó seis meses después. Dijo que si era malo tener una jefa como mujer, tener dos que, además, no se ponían de acuerdo, era lo peor que había vivido."
    dapd "He left six months later. He said that if it was bad to have one boss as a woman, to have two who, on top of that, couldn't agree, was the worst thing he'd ever experienced."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:674
translate english c20s002_Tavern_a693f7da:

    # mcd "*Risa* Puedo entenderle..."
    mcd "*Laugh* I can understand him..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:675
translate english c20s002_Tavern_0bc5cc42:

    # "Todas te miran con una ceja levantada. No a Vilfredo. A ti."
    "They all look at you with a raised eyebrow. Not at Vilfredo. At you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:676
translate english c20s002_Tavern_a885c1f4:

    # mcd "No porque sean mujeres, sino porque servir a dos amos que dan órdenes contradictorias es complicado."
    mcd "Not because they are women, but because serving two masters who give contradictory orders is tricky."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:677
translate english c20s002_Tavern_7b36fe22:

    # eri "*Tiempo Muerto* Bien salvado... *Risa*"
    eri "*Timeout* Nicely saved... *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:679
translate english c20s002_Tavern_8b1e9b0c:

    # emm "*Tiempo Muerto* Parecía que te arrepentías del harén. *Risa*"
    emm "*Timeout* You almost looked like you regretted the harem. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:680
translate english c20s002_Tavern_410268cc:

    # mc "*Tiempo Muerto* De eso nunca me arrepentiré. *Risa*"
    mc "*Timeout* I will never regret that! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:682
translate english c20s002_Tavern_67229098:

    # "Pasáis un rato en el que os explican a Maddie y a ti más cosas del mundo que [dap] ha diseñado, del pueblo, de los conflictos, de la política."
    "You spend some time in which they explain to Maddie and you more about the world that [dap] has designed, about the people, about the conflicts, about the politics."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:683
translate english c20s002_Tavern_ab074bbe:

    # "[dap] ha hecho un mundo creíble y profundo basado en una premisa muy original."
    "[dap] has crafted a believable and deep world based on a very original premise."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:684
translate english c20s002_Tavern_ea88dcd7:

    # "Durante casi toda la conversación, se mantienen fieles a sus personajes, solo haciendo la señal de Tiempo Muerto cuando tienen que aclarar algo que sus personajes no pueden decir."
    "Throughout most of the conversation, they stay true to their characters, only making the Timeout sign when they have to clarify something their characters can't say."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:685
translate english c20s002_Tavern_d9fce220:

    # "[emm] lo ve todo desde un punto de vista honorable, mientras Scarlett lo ve desde un punto de vista travieso. [eri] parece tener una perspectiva más cínica."
    "[emm] sees everything from an honorable point of view, while Scarlett sees it from a naughty angle. [eri] seems to have a more cynical perspective."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:686
translate english c20s002_Tavern_38c82950:

    # "[dap] actua de forma diferente. Siendo la DM a la vez que un personaje, no muestra juicios absolutos. Supones que, al saber todo lo que pasa y el por qué, mantiene la distancia."
    "[dap] acts differently. Being the DM as well as a character, she doesn't show absolute judgments. You assume that, knowing everything that happens and why, she keeps some distance."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:687
translate english c20s002_Tavern_68decc41:

    # "[dap] os indica que se está haciendo tarde."
    "[dap] tells you that it's getting late."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:689
translate english c20s002_Tavern_b0ea2665:

    # madd "Creo que yo voy a retirarme a mi habitación ya. La compañía es grata pero mañana tenemos una larga cabalgata. Y Vilfredo cabalga lento como un viejo Halfling."
    madd "I think I'm going to retire to my room now. The company is pleasant, but tomorrow we have a long ride. And Vilfredo rides as slow as an old Halfling."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:690
translate english c20s002_Tavern_c6eee103:

    # mcd "Ja. Ja. Yo también voy a irme a la cama. Fang tiene razón. Mañana tenemos que madrugar para llegar a Vindobona. Y no cabalgo tan lento."
    mcd " Ha. Ha. I'm going to go to bed too. Fang is right. Tomorrow we have to get up early to get to Vindobona. But I don't ride that slow."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:703
translate english c20s002_AMosquitoe_87bc7d71:

    # dap "Vale, mandadme un mensaje con lo que queréis hacer durante la noche. Puede ser dormir, salir a ver el pueblo de noche... lo que queráis dentro de la lógica."
    dap "Ok, send me a text with what you want to do during the night. It can be sleeping, going out to see the town at night... whatever you want within logic."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:704
translate english c20s002_AMosquitoe_29623f0a:

    # "Escribes un mensaje en el que indicas que vas a dormir. [dap] te pregunta si vestido o desnudo. Desnudo, obviamente."
    "You send her a text saying that you're going to sleep. [dap] asks you if clothed or naked. Naked, obviously."

