# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2137
translate english c20s004_Farewell_3e35ca29:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* Nos aseguramos de darle las gracias por las provisiones."
    mad "*In the real world* We made sure to thank her for the supplies."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2139
translate english c20s004_Farewell_b032d0ca:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* También nos despedimos de Alba, la chica a la que gritó que se ocupara de los clientes cuando llegaron los BDSM. Supongo que debe ser su ayudante."
    mad "*In the real world* We also said goodbye to Alba, the girl Marzia yelled at to take care of the customers when the BDSMs arrived. I guess she must be her assistant or a waitress."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2140
translate english c20s004_Farewell_d673b801:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Ni siquiera me acordaba de ella... no hemos interactuado con ella para nada."
    mc "*In the real world* I didn't even remember her... We didn't interact with her at all."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2141
translate english c20s004_Farewell_c8543d85:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* Bueno, se supone que si es la camarera de la taberna, nos habrá traído comida o bebida."
    mad "*In the real world* Well, one assumes that, if she's the waitress at the tavern, she must have brought us food or drink."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2142
translate english c20s004_Farewell_b2ad90a0:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Bien visto, Maddie. Scarlett, [eri], y [emm] casi siempre se olvidan de ella."
    dap "*In the real world* Nicely spotted, Maddie. Scarlett, [eri], and [emm] almost always forget about her."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2143
translate english c20s004_Farewell_785efda1:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* No hay rastro de Beagan, Aelia, Paula, o Pia."
    dap "*In the real world* There is no trace of Beagan, Aelia, Paula, or Pia."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2144
translate english c20s004_Farewell_11698653:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Le pedimos a Marzia que nos despida de ellas y nos vamos a los establos. No olvido las provisiones."
    mc "*In the real world* We ask Marzia to say goodbye to them and we're off to the stables. I'm not forgetting the supplies."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2146
translate english c20s004_Farewell_a38145c0:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* De camino a los establos veis a Thiel y el chico de la alabarda charlando, sentados en un banco."
    dap "*In the real world* On the way to the stables you see Thiel sitting on a bench, chatting with the halberd boy."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2148
translate english c20s004_Farewell_60a85db1:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* ¡Están cogidos de la mano! *Risa* Parece que tu fallo crítico ha creado una pareja en el pueblo."
    dap "*In the real world* They're holding hands! *Laugh* Looks like your critical failure has created a couple in town."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2150
translate english c20s004_Farewell_885f9659:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Me acerco a ellos para despedirnos... pero solo si no parece que vaya a interrumpir algo."
    mc "*In the real world* I approach them to say goodbye... but only if it doesn't look like I'm going to interrupt something."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2151
translate english c20s004_Farewell_166b13f1:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* Yo también me acerco. Quiero despedirme de los tortolitos."
    mad "*In the real world* I'm coming too. I want to say goodbye to the lovebirds."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2153
translate english c20s004_Farewell_87c418f9:

    # mcd "Thiel, [wil], nos vamos ya. Un placer haberos conocido."
    mcd "Thiel, [wil], we're leaving now. Nice to have met you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2154
translate english c20s004_Farewell_f149b226:

    # madd "Lo mismo digo, chicos."
    madd "Same here, guys."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2156
translate english c20s004_Farewell_360e7491:

    # thi "Muchas gracias por lo de ayer. Es una lástima que no se puedan quedar ustedes en el pueblo. La Señora Paula ya nos ha dicho que se tienen que marchar."
    thi "Thank you very much for what you did yesterday. It is a pity that you cannot stay in the village. Ma'am Paula already told us that you must leave."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2158
translate english c20s004_Farewell_c34ebee4:

    # madd "Sí, muchacha. Vamos a buscar trabajo a Vindobona."
    madd "Yes, girl. We are going to look for work in Vindobona."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2159
translate english c20s004_Farewell_fb4cbe08:

    # mcd "Nos han dicho que aquí no vamos a encontrar trabajo escoltando caravanas."
    mcd "We have been told that we are not going to find work escorting caravans here."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2161
translate english c20s004_Farewell_27f53f3c:

    # wil "Pero aquí hay mucho trabajo si lo quieren, hay muchas granjas sin manos que las trabajen. O podrían trabajar para las Protectoras."
    wil "But there is plenty of work here if you want it, there are so many farms without hands to work them. Or you could work for the Protectors."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2162
translate english c20s004_Farewell_3dcff2aa:

    # mcd "Suena tentador, pero no es el tipo de trabajo que buscamos ahora mismo."
    mcd "It sounds tempting, but it's not the kind of job we're looking for, right now."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2164
translate english c20s004_Farewell_af9de7cd:

    # thi "Es una lástima. Echaré de menos a Júpiter, Señora. Me cae muy bien. Me ha pedido que le dé las gracias por lo de Capua. No me ha dicho de qué se trata."
    thi "It's a pity. I will miss Jupiter, Ma'am. I like him very much. He has asked me to thank you for something that happened in Capua. He hasn't told me what it's about."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2166
translate english c20s004_Farewell_724d248b:

    # madd "¿Qué? ¿Puedes hablar con Júpiter?"
    madd "What? Can you speak with Jupiter?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2168
translate english c20s004_Farewell_cdd8f6cd:

    # thi "Claro... Soy una chica gato, al fin y al cabo. Habla con un acento raro, pero nos entendemos."
    thi "Sure... I'm a cat girl, after all. He speaks with a funny accent, but we understand each other."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2169
translate english c20s004_Farewell_5e9087b4:

    # mcd "*Risa* Me parece la mejor explicación que he oído nunca."
    mcd "*Laugh* Sounds like the best explanation I've ever heard."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2170
translate english c20s004_Farewell_8a10a3d2:

    # thi "Él le entiende casi todo lo que dice, al menos cuando habla Latín, pero no puede contestarle."
    thi "He understands almost everything you say, at least when you speak Latin, but he can't answer you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2172
translate english c20s004_Farewell_d58e1c0c:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* Abrazo a Júpiter."
    mad "*In the real world* I hug Jupiter."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2173
translate english c20s004_Farewell_6f8bb913:

    # madd "Sabes que eres mi compañero, gatito."
    madd "You know you're my partner, kitten."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2174
translate english c20s004_Farewell_3fb43df7:

    # jup "*Ronroneo*"
    jup "*Purr*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2175
translate english c20s004_Farewell_2d298b27:

    # thi "Dice que no podría tener una compañera mejor."
    thi "He says he couldn't have a better partner."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2177
translate english c20s004_Farewell_f5fac812:

    # mcd "Sólo queríamos despedirnos, chicos. Ha sido un placer conoceros."
    mcd "We just wanted to say goodbye, guys. It was nice meeting you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2179
translate english c20s004_Farewell_fd570581:

    # wil "Guardaré su moneda siempre, Señor. Muchas gracias."
    wil "I will keep your coin always, Sir. Thank you very much."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2180
translate english c20s004_Farewell_8d9f58ec:

    # mcd "*Susurrando* Si puedo darte un consejo, ponte un nombre más fácil de recordar, [wil]."
    mcd "*Whispering* If I may give you some advice, change your name to something that's easier to remember, [wil]."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2181
translate english c20s004_Farewell_e0e0f25c:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* *Risa*"
    mc "*In the real world* *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2183
translate english c20s004_Farewell_6cb39545:

    # wil "¡Oh, lo haré! Cuando tenga mi propia AVN."
    wil "Oh, I will do it! When I get my own AVN."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2185
translate english c20s004_Farewell_ae66b4fc:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* ¿Qué? ¿AVN?" (multiple=2)
    mc "*In the real world* What? AVN?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2186
translate english c20s004_Farewell_d1c1869d:

    # mcd "¿Qué quieres decir con AVN?" (multiple=2)
    mcd "What do you mean by AVN?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2188
translate english c20s004_Farewell_2f8db68f:

    # wil "Oh, sí, Señor. Agrum Vaccis Nostrum. Nuestro propio campo con vacas, para alimentar a mi familia."
    wil "Oh, yes, Sir. Agrum Vaccis Nostrum. Our own field with cows, to feed my family."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2189
translate english c20s004_Farewell_11ebef1d:

    # mcd "Me habías asustado, creía que te referías a otra cosa..."
    mcd "You scared me, I thought you meant something else..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2190
translate english c20s004_Farewell_27c39f60:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* *Risa* Eso es porque tienes una mente traviesa."
    dap "*In the real world* *Laugh* That's because you have a naughty mind."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2192
translate english c20s004_Farewell_b64267a5:

    # thi "No queremos entretenerles más, o si no van a llegar cuando las puertas de Vindobona ya estén cerradas."
    thi "We don't want to keep you any longer, or else you will arrive when the gates of Vindobona are already closed."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2193
translate english c20s004_Farewell_8da3180b:

    # mcd "Gracias, Thiel. Si volvemos a hacer esta ruta pararemos a saludaros."
    mcd "Thanks, Thiel. If we do this route again, we'll stop to say hello."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2194
translate english c20s004_Farewell_7e1b4108:

    # madd "Cuidaos, chicos."
    madd "Take care, guys."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2195
translate english c20s004_Farewell_93865483:

    # wil "Tengan cuidado ustedes en el camino. A veces... pasan cosas... y los viajeros desaparecen."
    wil "Be careful on the road. Sometimes... things happen... and travelers disappear."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2197
translate english c20s004_Farewell_e7e1a826:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Cuando llegáis a los establos, veis que Paula, Aelia, Beagan y Pia están allí. Esta vez sin armaduras."
    dap "*In the real world* When you arrive at the stables, you see Paula, Aelia, Beagan, and Pia there, waiting for you. This time they aren't wearing armor."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2199
translate english c20s004_Farewell_247c5474:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 21 – LUNES{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 21 - MONDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2201
translate english c20s004_Farewell_b7f824e7:

    # dapd "Creía que habíais decidido quedaros."
    dapd "You took your time. I thought maybe you decided to stay."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2203
translate english c20s004_Farewell_3868638f:

    # erid "Si nosotras tuviéramos que ir a Vindobona, Pia nos hubiera hecho salir al amanecer."
    erid "If we had to go to Vindobona, Pia would have had us leave at dawn."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2205
translate english c20s004_Farewell_8a2eb5dd:

    # scad "Y se hubiera pasado el camino quejándose de que no había dormido suficiente."
    scad "And she would have spent the whole way complaining that she didn't get enough sleep."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2207
translate english c20s004_Farewell_2991cdd8:

    # emmd "No os metáis con Pia. Al menos nos evita tener que hacer todos los cálculos de las provisiones que necesitamos."
    emmd "Don't screw with Pia. At least she saves us from having to do all the calculations of the supplies we need."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2209
translate english c20s004_Farewell_ef93e412:

    # mad "Muchas gracias por las cervezas de anoche, chicas."
    mad "Thanks so much for the beers last evening, girls."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2210
translate english c20s004_Farewell_24aa2dc7:

    # mcd "Y por lo de después... la cena... me refiero..."
    mcd "And for what happened afterwards... the dinner... I mean..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2212
translate english c20s004_Farewell_5c3bfa02:

    # emmd "Hemos ensillado vuestros caballos..."
    emmd "We have saddled your horses..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2213
translate english c20s004_Farewell_fca62baf:

    # erid "Y os hemos puesto un par de mantas extra, en caso de que encontréis una caravana que vaya más al norte de Vindobona. Hace frío allí."
    erid "And we've packed a couple of extra blankets for you, in case you find a caravan going further north of Vindobona. It's cold there."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2214
translate english c20s004_Farewell_9555181e:

    # dapd "Si volvéis a pasar por Novum Templum, no os olvidéis de parar a saludar."
    dapd "If you ever stop by Novum Templum, don't forget to take a break and say hello."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2215
translate english c20s004_Farewell_91d0d3fe:

    # scad "Y a traernos noticias de lo que pasa en el resto del Imperio. Casi no nos enteramos de nada aquí."
    scad "And to bring us news of what's going on in the rest of the Empire. We hardly hear anything about it here."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2218
translate english c20s004_Farewell_5b196794:

    # mad "¿Queda mucho, [dap]? Mañana me tengo que levantar pronto para abrir la tienda."
    mad "Is there much left, [dap]? I have to get up early tomorrow to open the store."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2219
translate english c20s004_Farewell_2c223719:

    # mad "No quiero estropear la partida, pero si va a durar mucho más, ¿podríamos dejarlo para otro día?"
    mad "I don't want to spoil the game, but if it's going to take much longer, could we put it on hold for another day?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2221
translate english c20s004_Farewell_7e0c9c16:

    # dap "Solo quedan diez minutos a lo sumo. Vamos a acelerar un poco."
    dap "Only ten minutes left at most. Let's speed it up a bit."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2222
translate english c20s004_Farewell_04496536:

    # dap "Acabáis las despedidas y emprendéis camino. Es un día soleado. Parece que la amenaza de lluvia va desapareciendo tal como vais hacia el norte."
    dap "You finish your farewells and start on your way. It is a sunny day. The threat of rain seems to be disappearing as you head north."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2225
translate english c20s004_Farewell_03ac580c:

    # emm "Vaya, yo quería despedirme de Vilfredo como es debido."
    emm "Geez, I wanted to say goodbye to Vilfredo properly."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2227
translate english c20s004_Farewell_6f17ff93:

    # eri "[emm], Maddie es la única aquí que tiene que madrugar. Tenemos que adaptar la partida a ella."
    eri "[emm], Maddie is the only one here who has to get up early. We have to adapt the game to her."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2228
translate english c20s004_Farewell_00b68d56:

    # eri "Y ni se te ocurra sentirte mal, Maddie. Lo hacemos encantadas."
    eri "And don't even think about feeling bad about it, Maddie. We do it gladly."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2230
translate english c20s004_Farewell_9780c57c:

    # mad "Gracias, [eri]."
    mad "Thanks, [eri]."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2232
translate english c20s004_Farewell_7109b629:

    # dap "Bueno, vamos a acelerar un poco."
    dap "Well, let's accelerate a little to finish earlier."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2233
translate english c20s004_Farewell_d1e6de3e:

    # dap "Cuando lleváis un par de horas cabalgando oís un ruido. Tirad por Percepción."
    dap "When you have been riding for a couple of hours you hear a noise. Roll for Perception."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2235
translate english c20s004_Farewell_b3015543:

    # mad "15. Con los bonos sumados, 18."
    mad "15. With the added bonuses, 18."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2236
translate english c20s004_Farewell_2012bbd5:

    # mc "12... ¿qué bonos había que sumar?... Ah, sí, Sabiduría. No tengo bono. 12."
    mc "12... what bonuses should I add...? Ah, yes, Wisdom. I have no bonus. 12."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2238
translate english c20s004_Farewell_32adb331:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Miráis al cielo, hacia el Norte, y veis un dragón, rojo infernal, volando hacia el Oeste."
    dap "*In the real world* You look up at the sky, to the North, and see a dragon, hellish red, flying West."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2239
translate english c20s004_Farewell_767472c8:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Maddie, tu dirías que es un ejemplar muy viejo, y que llevaba algo en las garras, pero no puedes percibir qué es."
    dap "*In the real world* Maddie, you'd say it's a very old specimen, and it's carrying something in its claws, but you can't discern what it is."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2240
translate english c20s004_Farewell_52e72fa8:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Además, ves al Noreste una pequeña columna de humo."
    dap "*In the real world* Also, you see to the Northeast a small plume of smoke."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2242
translate english c20s004_Farewell_b69bc0a5:

    # madd "¿Has visto el dragón?"
    madd "Did you see that dragon?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2243
translate english c20s004_Farewell_d8710b26:

    # mcd "Nunca había visto uno. Creo que será difícil olvidarlo..."
    mcd "I've never seen one before. I think it will be hard to forget..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2245
translate english c20s004_Farewell_919b1d43:

    # madd "Hay humo allí. Deberíamos acercarnos."
    madd "There's smoke over there. We should get closer."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2246
translate english c20s004_Farewell_bfd38439:

    # mcd "Te sigo. A lo mejor alguien necesita ayuda."
    mcd "Lead the way. Maybe someone needs help."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2248
translate english c20s004_Farewell_3dc7746f:

    # madd "Por aquí. Este camino parece llevar hacia el humo."
    madd "This way. This road seems to lead toward the smoke."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2250
translate english c20s004_Farewell_7007417b:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Llegáis a un claro al lado del camino, donde alguien ha acampado para comer."
    dap "*In the real world* You arrive at a clearing by the side of the road, where someone has set up camp for lunch."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2251
translate english c20s004_Farewell_d3047ce0:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* No hay nadie, pero el fuego está encendido aún con carne en el espeto. Obiamente, la columna de humo salía de aquí."
    dap "*In the real world* No one is there, but the fire is still burning with meat on the spit. Obviously, the plume of smoke was billowing out of here."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2252
translate english c20s004_Farewell_9bec8cf5:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* Busco huellas. 8+3. 11. No creo que encuentre nada demasiado interesante."
    mad "*In the real world* I look for footprints. 8+3. 11. I don't think I'll find anything too interesting."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2253
translate english c20s004_Farewell_8d374f57:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Ves huellas que van en varias direcciones. El grupo más numeroso va al Norte."
    dap "*In the real world* You see footprints going in various directions. The largest group went north."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2255
translate english c20s004_Farewell_24c78b59:

    # madd "El grupo que había acampado aquí se ha separado. Vamos a seguir las huellas que van al Norte."
    madd "The group that had camped here split up. Let's follow the tracks going north."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2256
translate english c20s004_Farewell_550def09:

    # mcd "Como quieras. Tu te mueves por los bosques mejor que yo."
    mcd "As you want. You get around the woods better than I do."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2258
translate english c20s004_Farewell_56891888:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Llegáis a un claro en el que encontráis una escena dantesca. Hay un par de cadáveres quemados. Uno boca arriba y el otro boca abajo."
    dap "*In the real world* You arrive at a clearing where you find a gruesome scene. There are a couple of burned corpses. One lying on his back and the other facing down."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2259
translate english c20s004_Farewell_b1bfdb6e:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* No parecen haber sido atacados aquí, sino un poco antes, donde habéis visto hierba quemada. Parece que han corrido hasta aquí antes de morir."
    dap "*In the real world* They don't seem to have been attacked here, but a little earlier, where you saw a patch of burnt grass. It seems they ran here before they died."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2260
translate english c20s004_Farewell_4a2eb8a8:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Reconocéis la armadura que llevaban los alabarderos en uno de los cadáveres. No lleva la capa."
    dap "*In the real world* You recognize the armor worn by the halberdiers on the corpse lying on his back. He's not wearing the cloak."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2261
translate english c20s004_Farewell_5820e84c:

    # mc "*En el mundo real* Le doy la vuelta al otro."
    mc "*In the real world* I turn the other one around."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2263
translate english c20s004_Farewell_a9dc35cc:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Incluso antes de darle la vuelta, reconoces la armadura. Es la misma que llevaba Euricus, aunque le faltan algunas piezas."
    dap "*In the real world* Even before you turn him over, you recognize the armor. It's the same one Euricus wore, though it's missing a few pieces."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2264
translate english c20s004_Farewell_48cc2da4:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* En el momento en que le das la vuelta, lo reconoces pese a que está bastante churruscado."
    dap "*In the real world* The moment you turn him over, you recognize him even though he's pretty scorched. He has no hair or eyelashes remaining."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2265
translate english c20s004_Farewell_cd7b56ba:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* ¿Está el cadáver de Solomon por algún lado?"
    mad "*In the real world* Can I find Solomon's corpse around?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2266
translate english c20s004_Farewell_71b45c17:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Tira por Inteligencia."
    dap "*In the real world* Roll for Intelligence."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2267
translate english c20s004_Farewell_172177b2:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* ¡Sí! 20 natural. Pero le resto 1. Fang no es muy inteligente."
    mad "*In the real world* Yes! Natural 20. But I subtract 1. Fang isn't very bright."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2268
translate english c20s004_Farewell_169eaa96:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Para nosotras, un 20 natural siempre es un éxito crítico. Así simplificamos las normas."
    dap "*In the real world* For us, a natural 20 is always a critical success. That's how we simplify the rules."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2270
translate english c20s004_Farewell_6553f9a6:

    # dap "*En el mundo real* Recuerdas la cosa negra que llevaba el dragón entre las garras. Crees que podría ser Solomon."
    dap "*In the real world* You remember the dragon was carrying something in its claws. You think it might be Solomon."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2271
translate english c20s004_Farewell_051216b6:

    # mad "*En el mundo real* ¡Sí! !Acabar como el almuerzo de un dragón! ¡Ahí tienes tu criatura roja infernal chupadora de almas! ¡Jódete, cabrón! ¡Uy, perdón!"
    mad "*In the real world* Yes! End up as a dragon's lunch! There's your redheaded soul-sucking hellish creature! Fuck you, bastard! Oops, sorry!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2272
translate english c20s004_Farewell_b3b94564:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2274
translate english c20s004_Farewell_a1798ea5:

    # madd "Creo que deberíamos volver a Novum Templum, Vilfredo. Deberíamos avisarles de que hay un dragón en las inmediaciones."
    madd "I think we should go back to Novum Templum, Vilfredo. We should warn them that there is a dragon in the vicinity."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2275
translate english c20s004_Farewell_6fa26c98:

    # mcd "Me parece que no deben saberlo, o nos lo hubieran dicho. ¡Volvamos!"
    mcd "I think they must not know, or they would have told us. Let's go back!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2276
translate english c20s004_Farewell_4a222b01:

    # madd "Vamos. Vindobona tendrá que esperar."
    madd "Let's go. Vindobona will have to wait."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2278
translate english c20s004_Farewell_449382bd:

    # mcd "Fang, presiento que este es el comienzo de una hermosa amistad."
    mcd "Fang, I think this is the beginning of a beautiful friendship."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2281
translate english c20s004_Farewell_a5790ee4:

    # dap "Y con esto acaba la sesión de hoy. Espero que os haya gustado."
    dap "And that's the end of today's session. I hope you liked it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2307
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_a5790ee4:

    # dap "Y con esto acaba la sesión de hoy. Espero que os haya gustado."
    dap "And that's the end of today's session. I hope you liked it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2309
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_1a297f42:

    # mad "Como introducción al mundo y al grupo ha sido fantástico."
    mad "As an introduction to the world and the group it was simply brilliant."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2310
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_4ae9fcaa:

    # mad "No es la típica forma de introducir nuevos miembros en plan \"Os encontráis en una taberna y parecéis amigos de toda la vida\"."
    mad "It's not the typical way of introducing new members in a \"You meet in a tavern, and you look like lifelong friends\" way."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2313
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_5625d6c4:

    # sca "Es más un \"Os encontráis en el foro y os folláis al Semielfo\". *Risa*"
    sca "It's more of a \"You meet at the forum and fuck the Half-Elf\" way. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2314
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_b3b94564:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2317
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_7b8058c9:

    # emm "*Risa* Había que darle razones para volver, ¿no?"
    emm "*Laugh* We had to give him reasons to return, didn't we?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2318
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_3eba9f66:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que [dap] nos hubiera dado razones suficientes igualmente."
    mc "*Laugh* I think [dap] would have given us enough reasons anyway."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2320
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_c15b942d:

    # eri "Ahora hay que darle razones a [madd] para que se quede."
    eri "Now we have to give [madd] reasons to stay."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2322
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_6e4fee88:

    # dap "Por eso habéis conocido a unos enemigos comunes. Además, Vilfredo y Fang volverán para dar la noticia del dragón."
    dap "That is why you met some common enemies. Besides, Vilfredo and Fang will return to deliver the news about the dragon."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2323
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_9c2b3da1:

    # dap "Suma a eso que ahora Fang tiene una razón para quedarse. Tiene un intérprete para hablar con Júpiter."
    dap "Add to that the fact that Fang now has a reason to stay.. She has an interpreter to talk to Jupiter."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2326
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_f359061e:

    # mad "Y visto lo que pasó anoche, quizás se plantee probar a Vilfredo. Aunque también podría haberlo hecho en Vindobona."
    mad "And given what happened last night, maybe she'll consider trying Vilfredo. Although I could have also done it in Vindobona."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2329
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_f8a96c09:

    # mad "*Risa* Es la única idiota que se fue a dormir y se quedó sin diversión."
    mad "*Laugh* Fang's the only idiot who went to sleep and missed out on all the fun."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2331
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_849e73e9:

    # bet "A mí me ha parecido muy interesante descubrir esas facetas de mis cuatro sobrinas."
    bet "I found it very interesting to discover these facets about my four nieces."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2334
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_4b8e0ca6:

    # bet "A mí me ha parecido muy interesante descubrir esas facetas de mis cuatro sobrinas, aunque [mc] las rechazara."
    bet "I found it very interesting to discover those facets about my four nieces, even though [mc] rejected them."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2336
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_240e4faf:

    # dap "¿Por qué no te unes, Tía Betty? Siempre hay espacio para más Clérigos en el grupo. Los hechizos de curación de Pia no son eternos y ahora somos más."
    dap "Why don't you join, Aunt Betty? There's always room for more Clerics in the group. Pia's healing spells won't last forever, and there are more of us now."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2338
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_7fccd2cc:

    # bet "*Risa* ¿Me estás diciendo que me una al grupo y me haga una monja curandera en vez de follarme al Semielfo?"
    bet "*Laugh* Are you telling me to join the group and become a healing nun instead of fucking the Half-Elf?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2339
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_c501fb12:

    # bet "¿Tú te das cuenta de la ironía de eso? *Risa* Me he pasado casi toda mi vida siendo precisamente una monja curandera."
    bet "Do you realize the irony of that? *Laugh* I've spent most of my life being just a healing nun."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2341
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_2ac73579:

    # sca "*Risa* Creo que [dap] no lo había pensado. Si quieres puedes jugar con un guerrero o un mago..."
    sca "*Laugh* I guess [dap] hadn't thought of that. If you want you can play a warrior or a wizard..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2342
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_1a93d918:

    # sca "Aunque te hagas una monja, te puedes follar a [mc] igualmente. *Risa*"
    sca "Even if you become a nun, you can still fuck [mc]. It's not like this is real life. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2344
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_1525074d:

    # sca "Sólo tienes que ver a [dap], la Semielfa putilla. *Risa*"
    sca "Just look at [dap], the slutty-prude Half-Elf. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2346
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_01267f8c:

    # bet "Me ha parecido que os lo pasabais muy bien. Podría ser divertido unirme, ahora que parece que no voy a volver a Florida."
    bet "It looked like you guys were having a great time. Might be fun to join in, now that it seems like I won't be going back to Florida."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2348
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_d500f517:

    # bet "Pero dejadme pensarlo unos días..."
    bet "But let me think about it for a few days..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2349
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_aac421b9:

    # mcp "(Al menos hasta la visita a Monterey, ¿no?)"
    mcp "(At least until the visit to Monterey, right?)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2351
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_491b2c1b:

    # emm "No es que te quiera echar, Mads, pero ¿tú no tenías que madrugar?"
    emm "Not that I want to kick you out, Mads, but didn't you have to get up early?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2353
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_eb79b050:

    # mad "Sí, pero una de las cosas más divertidas de las partidas es comentarlas luego... Estoy dispuesta a sacrificar una hora de sueño."
    mad "Yes, but one of the most fun things about games is commenting on them afterwards... I'm willing to sacrifice an hour of sleep."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2355
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_6649c9db:

    # eri "No es necesario, Maddie. Mañana iremos todas a la tienda y comentaremos la partida si quieres. Así puedes dormir tranquilamente hoy."
    eri "No need, Maddie. Tomorrow we'll all go to the boutique and discuss the game if you want. You can sleep some hours today, that way."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2357
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_8c0b47f6:

    # sca "Prometemos no comentar nada antes de ir, para que no te pierdas nada de la conversación."
    sca "We promise not to comment on anything before we go see you, so you won't miss any of the conversation."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2359
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_56648120:

    # mad "Chicas, os lo agradezco. Ha sido un día largo y empiezo a estar cansada."
    mad "Girls, I appreciate it. It's been a long day and I'm starting to get tired."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2362
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_9abc610e:

    # mad "Casi tanto como Vilfredo. *Risa*"
    mad "Almost as much as Vilfredo. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2363
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_f7fd3149:

    # mc "¡Hey! El Semielfo ya ha recargado las baterías. Está listo para más rounds. *Risa*"
    mc "Hey! The Half-Elf has already recharged his batteries. He's ready for more rounds. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2365
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_5d2e6c01:

    # dap "Entonces quedamos así. Mañana en la tienda. No te queremos entretener más y sentirnos culpables si te quedas dormida en un probador. *Risa*"
    dap "Then we agree on this. Tomorrow at the store. We don't want to keep you any longer and feel guilty if you fall asleep in a fitting room. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2366
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_b3b94564_1:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2368
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_f5dbebe2:

    # mad "Gracias, chicas."
    mad "Thank you, girls."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2369
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_6598ab25:

    # mc "Te llevo. ¿Tienes que coger alguna cosa?"
    mc "I'll give you a ride. Do you have everything?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2371
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_9002c104:

    # mad "Tengo la mochila en la habitación de [eri]. Ahora bajo con ella. Las cajas de los cuadros ya están en la camioneta."
    mad "I have my backpack in [eri]'s room. I'll go to get it now. The boxes of the paintings are already in the pickup truck."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2372
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_e5a907d7:

    # mc "Perfecto entonces. Voy al lavabo y te veo en el garaje."
    mc "Perfect then. I'll go to the restroom and meet you in the garage."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2373
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_df5c0f2c:

    # eri "Te acompaño, Maddie."
    eri "I'm going with you, Maddie."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2375
translate english c20s005_EndGameFarewell_ae82c249:

    # "Te despides de las chicas y de Tía Betty y vas al lavabo."
    "You say goodbye to the girls and Aunt Betty and go to the restroom."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2388
translate english c20s005_Kia_e56161b3:

    # "Al salir del lavabo, te encuentras con Kiara en el pasillo."
    "As you come out of the restroom, you meet Kiara in the hallway."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2389
translate english c20s005_Kia_15498345:

    # mc "¡Hola, Kiara! Perdón si te he despertado."
    mc "Hi, Kiara! Sorry if I woke you up."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2395
translate english c20s005_Kia_c2279c91:

    # kia "No te preocupes. No podía dormir y te he escuchado subir las escaleras. He venido a ver si tenías un momento para hablar."
    kia "Don't worry. I couldn't sleep and I heard you coming up the stairs. I came to see if you had a moment to talk."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2396
translate english c20s005_Kia_b8414fd1:

    # mc "Ahora no es buen momento, Kiara. Tengo que llevar a Maddie a casa."
    mc "I can't right now, Kiara. I have to take Maddie home."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2399
translate english c20s005_Kia_a4065204:

    # kia "¿Vas a volver a casa o te vas a quedar a dormir?"
    kia "Are you coming back home or staying over?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2401
translate english c20s005_Kia_7716d653:

    # kia "No te estoy fiscalizando... Es que me gustaría hablar contigo..."
    kia "I'm not controlling you... It's just that I'd like to talk to you..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2404
translate english c20s005_Kia_5a1fc550:

    # kia "¿Vas a tardar mucho? Me gustaría hablar contigo..."
    kia "Are you going to be long? I'd like to talk to you..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2405
translate english c20s005_Kia_a4795cec:

    # mc "La llevo a casa y vuelvo en seguida. ¿Quieres que hablemos cuando vuelva?"
    mc "I'll take her home and I'll be right back. Do you want to talk when I get back?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2407
translate english c20s005_Kia_4e0d1f0f:

    # kia "Me parece fantástico. Te veo en un rato, entonces."
    kia "Yes, please. Sounds great. I'll see you in a bit, then."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2408
translate english c20s005_Kia_e4695014:

    # mc "¿No vas a darme un beso antes de irme?"
    mc "Aren't you going to kiss me before I go?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2410
translate english c20s005_Kia_d4e8547d:

    # kia "Creía que era solamente en los buenos días y buenas noches..."
    kia "I thought it was only good morning and good night..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2411
translate english c20s005_Kia_15557826:

    # mc "Así era antes de que tú y yo estuviéramos juntos."
    mc "That's how it was before you and I were together."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2412
translate english c20s005_Kia_8da7fb88:

    # mc "Porque estamos juntos, ¿verdad?"
    mc "Because we're together, right?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2414
translate english c20s005_Kia_d82d5c59:

    # kia "De eso es de lo que quiero hablar contigo... Pero mejor luego, cuando vuelvas."
    kia "That's what I want to talk to you about... But better later, when you come back."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2415
translate english c20s005_Kia_8a4b213f:

    # mc "Como desees."
    mc "As you wish."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2417
translate english c20s005_Kia_96c2af65:

    # kia "Hasta dentro de un rato, [mc]."
    kia "See you in a while, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2418
translate english c20s005_Kia_933e9869:

    # mc "Hasta luego, Kiara."
    mc "See you later, Kiara."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2478
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_36ef4791:

    # "Unos minutos después, después de haber sacado la camioneta del garaje..."
    "A few minutes later, after pulling the pickup out of the garage..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2479
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_16efac19:

    # mad "Ya nos podemos ir. Ya me he despedido de las chicas y de Betty."
    mad "We can go now. I've already said goodbye to the girls and Betty."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2480
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_bbc35977:

    # mc "Cuando quieras podemos irnos, entonces."
    mc "Whenever you're ready, then."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2482
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_da70b486:

    # "Al llegar al edificio de Maddie le ayudas a subir las cajas de los cuadros y te despides de ella."
    "When you get to Maddie's building, you help her carry the boxes of paintings upstairs and say goodbye to her."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2483
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_a678922f:

    # mad "Muchas gracias por todo, [mc]. Ha sido un día fantástico."
    mad "Thank you so much for everything, [mc]. It's been a fantastic day."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2484
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_d8cf74d5:

    # mc "Bienvenida a la familia. Bienvenida a los Locos Marks. *Risa* Espero que, a partir de ahora vengas a casa más a menudo."
    mc "Welcome to the family. Welcome to the Crazy Marks. *Laugh* I hope, from now on, you'll come home more often."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2487
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_c14779c4:

    # mad "Lo haré, no lo dudes. Ahora, si no te importa, debería irme a dormir."
    mad "I will, don't worry. Now, if you don't mind, I should go to sleep."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2488
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_eba3cfdd:

    # mc "Ningún problema. ¿Zeus está durmiendo? Me gustaría conocerlo."
    mc "No problem. Is Zeus sleeping? I'd like to meet him."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2494
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_eb2c2306:

    # "Parece que el gato ha oído su nombre y aparece para saludar."
    "It seems the cat heard his name and pops up to greet you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2495
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_fabc3ed0:

    # zeu "*Ronroneo* (¿Quién eres tú? ¿Vienes a acariciarme? ¡Bien hecho, humano!)"
    zeu "*Purr* (Who are you? Did you come to pet me? Well done, Human!)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2496
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_7228dac7:

    # mc "*Risa* Parece que me ha oído."
    mc "*Laugh* It looks like you heard me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2497
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_ade7fb2e:

    # mad "*Risa* En cuanto oye su nombre aparece como salido de la nada. Si son mis amigas se vuelve a esconder."
    mad "*Laugh* As soon as he hears his name he appears as if out of nowhere. If it's my friends, he goes back to hiding."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2498
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_f5e03bef:

    # mad "Parece que contigo tiene curiosidad."
    mad "It looks like he's curious about you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2500
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_4e4279df:

    # zeu "*Ronroneo* (Sus amigas son idiotas y se ríen como gallinas. Eres un humano que acaricia bien, me gustas.)"
    zeu "*Purr* (Your friends are idiots and laugh like hens. You're a good petting human, I like you.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2501
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_65826775:

    # mc "Encantado de conocerte por fin, Zeus. He visto unos cuadros fantásticos tuyos."
    mc "Nice to finally meet you, Zeus. I've seen some fantastic paintings of you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2502
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_da4f0765:

    # zeu "*Ronroneo* (Soy muy versátil. Gótico y Científico a la vez. No hablaremos del vestido rosa. Eso nunca pasó. Tengo que hablar con mi psicólogo.)"
    zeu "*Purr* (I'm very versatile. Goth and Scientist at the same time. We won't talk about the pink dress. That never happened. I have to talk to my psychologist.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2504
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_b2b41e5c:

    # mc "Bueno, Maddie, te dejo ir a acostarte. A ver si mañana puedo pasarme por la tienda con las chicas para comentar la partida."
    mc "Well, Maddie, I'll let you go to bed. Let's see if I can stop by the store tomorrow with the girls to discuss the game."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2505
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_7f43c3b1:

    # mad "OK. Hasta mañana, [mc]."
    mad "OK. See you tomorrow, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2507
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_a6cf6482:

    # "Te subes a la camioneta y emprendes el camino a casa."
    "You get in the pickup truck and set out on the road home."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2510
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_78d12f4c:

    # mad "Lo haré. No puedo dejar a Vilfredo solo en el bosque, habiendo un dragón rondando por ahí. *Risa*"
    mad "I'll do it. I can't leave Vilfredo alone in the forest, when there's a dragon roaming around. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2511
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_f166ab00:

    # mc "No me refiero solo a las partidas de DnD. Me refiero a las actividades familiares."
    mc "I'm not just talking about the DnD games. I'm referring to family activities."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2512
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_4dd3c1b8:

    # mc "Le has caído genial a todo el mundo que no te conocía, y ya les gustabas a las que te conocían."
    mc "Everyone who never met you before, liked you, and those who knew you already, enjoyed your company."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2515
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_8baf9429:

    # mad "Sobre eso..."
    mad "About that..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2516
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_4f14a2cb:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa Maddie?"
    mc "What happens Maddie?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2519
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_d6037b75:

    # mad "Me mentiste..."
    mad "You lied to me..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2520
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_e73f25b2:

    # mc "¿En qué? No lo entiendo. Nunca te he mentido."
    mc "About what? I don't understand. I've never lied to you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2522
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_75ada0a2:

    # mad "Estás saliendo con [mar]..."
    mad "You are dating [mar]..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2524
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_fbe6db5e:

    # mad "Incluso está embarazada..."
    mad "She's even pregnant with your kid..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2525
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_e3bab36f:

    # mc "Nunca te dije que no lo estuviera haciendo..."
    mc "I never told you I wasn't..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2527
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_84ecc7e4:

    # mad "Pero aceptaste mi chantaje."
    mad "But you accepted my blackmail."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2528
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_6da9e9f8:

    # mc "Porque quería ver dónde iba. Quería probar como era sentirse dominado."
    mc "Because I wanted to see where it could go. I wanted to try what it was like to feel dominated."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2530
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_027922b0:

    # mad "Me estás diciendo que nunca tuve poder sobre ti, ¿no?"
    mad "You're telling me I never had power over you, aren't you?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2531
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_32b8280f:

    # mc "No es eso. Tenías poder sobre mí porque yo te lo dejaba tener. No porque el secreto que guardabas fuera a hacerme daño si lo revelabas."
    mc "It's not that. You had power over me because I let you have it. Not because the secret you were keeping was going to hurt me if you revealed it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2532
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_ed69ab30:

    # mc "Seguramente [mar] se sentiría halagada si lo hicieras."
    mc "Surely [mar] would be flattered if you did."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2534
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_1b34f9ba:

    # mad "Me alegro de que lo hicieras. Aunque me he sentido un poco idiota cuando he descubierto la verdad."
    mad "I'm glad you did. Although I felt like a bit of an idiot when I found out the truth."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2535
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_d5002491:

    # mad "Y eso me lleva a otra pregunta..."
    mad "And that brings up another question..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2536
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_185a3c0f:

    # mc "Dime, Maddie. Sabes que puedes hablar de cualquier cosa conmigo."
    mc "Tell me, Maddie. You know you can talk about anything with me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2538
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_17c8bf13:

    # mad "¿Quiere decir eso que estabas conmigo porque querías? ¿No porque yo te obligara?"
    mad "Does that mean you were with me because you wanted to, not because I forced you?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2539
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_20004a1b:

    # mc "Sí. Estaba contigo porque quería. No podías obligarme, Maddie. El secreto no tenía ningún poder sobre mí."
    mc "Yes. I was with you because I wanted to be. You couldn't force me to do it, Maddie. The secret had no power over me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2541
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_c524525a:

    # mad "Entonces te libero. No quiero estar contigo así."
    mad "Then I release you. I don't want to be with you like this."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2544
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_d6037b75_1:

    # mad "Me mentiste..."
    mad "You lied to me..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2545
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_e73f25b2_1:

    # mc "¿En qué? No lo entiendo. Nunca te he mentido."
    mc "About what? I don't understand. I've never lied to you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2547
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_75ada0a2_1:

    # mad "Estás saliendo con [mar]..."
    mad "You are dating [mar]..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2549
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_fbe6db5e_1:

    # mad "Incluso está embarazada..."
    mad "She's even pregnant with your kid..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2550
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_e3bab36f_1:

    # mc "Nunca te dije que no lo estuviera haciendo..."
    mc "I never told you I wasn't..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2552
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_6dd08023:

    # mad "Pero mi intento de chantaje..."
    mad "But my blackmail attempt..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2553
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_753a680c:

    # mc "Tú intentaste chantajearme antes de que estuviéramos juntos. Nada cambia."
    mc "You tried to blackmail me before she and I were together. Nothing changes."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2555
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_f837d6fe:

    # mad "Me estás diciendo que, aunque hubiera salido bien nunca hubiera tenido poder sobre ti, ¿no?"
    mad "You're telling me that, even if it had worked, I would never have had power over you, aren't you?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2556
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_e2e209c3:

    # mc "Más o menos. A menos que yo te lo hubiera dejado tener. Seguramente [mar] se sentiría halagada si lo hicieras."
    mc "Sort of. Unless I would have let you have it. Surely [mar] would be flattered if you tried to tell her the secret you were trying to blackmail me about."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2557
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_5519561f:

    # mc "Pero le dimos la vuelta y ahora soy yo el que tiene poder sobre ti, ¿no?"
    mc "But we turned it around and now I'm the one who has power over you, right?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2559
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_1b34f9ba_1:

    # mad "Me alegro de que lo hicieras. Aunque me he sentido un poco idiota cuando he descubierto la verdad."
    mad "I'm glad you did. Although I felt like a bit of an idiot when I found out the truth."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2560
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_d5002491_1:

    # mad "Y eso me lleva a otra pregunta..."
    mad "And that brings up another question..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2561
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_185a3c0f_1:

    # mc "Dime, Maddie. Sabes que puedes hablar de cualquier cosa conmigo."
    mc "Tell me, Maddie. You know you can talk about anything with me."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2563
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_d3d03417:

    # mad "¿Quiere decir eso que estás conmigo sólo porque tienes poder sobre mí?"
    mad "Does that mean you are with me only because you have power over me?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2564
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_48639672:

    # mc "No. Estoy contigo porque quiero estarlo. No esperaba estarlo en estas circunstancias, pero me gusta estar contigo."
    mc "No. I'm with you because I want to be. I didn't expect to be under these circumstances, but I like being with you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2566
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_38efc1b3:

    # mad "Entonces, si quieres, puedes denunciarme a mi jefe."
    mad "Then, if you want, you can report me to my boss."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2567
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_65b1fd2a:

    # mad "No quiero estar contigo así."
    mad "I don't want to be with you like this."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2569
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_c05ecd45:

    # mc "{b}¿Qué?{/b} ¿Estás rompiendo conmigo?"
    mc "{b}What?{/b} Are you breaking up with me?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2571
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_e25417f1:

    # mad "Sí. Espérame aquí un momento. Ahora vuelvo."
    mad "Yes. Wait for me here for a moment. I'll be right back."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2572
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_704e54a3:

    # mc "¿Me he perdido algo? No te entiendo."
    mc "Did I miss something? I don't understand."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2574
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_db54acf2:

    # zeu "¡Miau! (¿Qué le has hecho ahora? ¡Me caías bien!)"
    zeu "Meow! (What have you done to her now? I liked you and now she's upset!)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2575
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_1dee14f4:

    # mc "Hola, pequeñín. ¿Sabes que le ha pasado a Maddie? ¿Me has echado de menos?"
    mc "Hey, little guy. Do you know what happened to Maddie? Did you miss me?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2576
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_c3aae098:

    # zeu "¡Miau! (No tengo ni idea de qué le has hecho. Y sobre echarte de menos, depende. ¿Me has traído atún para una cena tardía?)"
    zeu "Meow! (I have no idea what you did to her. And about missing you, it depends. Did you bring me tuna for a late dinner?)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2578
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_9ee1b869:

    # zeu "*Ronroneo* (Vale, te perdono... Pero que no se vuelva a repetir.)"
    zeu "*Purr* (Okay, I forgive you... But don't let it happen again.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2579
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_f20a31cc:

    # mc "Yo también te he echado de menos. Tus cuadros han triunfado mucho."
    mc "I've missed you too. The paintings you modeled for have been very successful."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2580
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_da4f0765_1:

    # zeu "*Ronroneo* (Soy muy versátil. Gótico y Científico a la vez. No hablaremos del vestido rosa. Eso nunca pasó. Tengo que hablar con mi psicólogo.)"
    zeu "*Purr* (I'm very versatile. Goth and Scientist at the same time. We won't talk about the pink dress. That never happened. I have to talk to my psychologist.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2582
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_5708e270:

    # mad "Hola, [mc]. ¿Puedo ayudarte en algo?"
    mad "Hi, [mc]. Can I help you with anything?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2583
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_60c7fe73:

    # mc "Hola de nuevo, Maddie. ¿Esas gafas?"
    mc "Hello again, Maddie. What's the matter with those glasses?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2585
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_9bc8c161:

    # mad "Creo que te equivocas. Maddie vive aquí, pero no lleva gafas. Yo soy Madison... No... Claire... Kent."
    mad "I think you're wrong. Maddie lives here, but she doesn't wear glasses. I'm Madison... No... Claire... Kent."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2586
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_9c84e9bf:

    # mcp "(OK. Sigamos el juego. Solo te falta una cabina de teléfono para cambiarte de vestimenta.)"
    mcp "(OK. Let's play along. All you're missing is a phone booth to change outfits.)"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2587
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_2890b878:

    # mc "Perdón por la confusión. Mi amiga me ha dicho algo que no entiendo y se ha ido."
    mc "Sorry for the confusion. My friend said something I don't understand and left."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2589
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_59b0dbd7:

    # mad "Sí, ha roto contigo. No quiere seguir teniendo la relación que ha tenido hasta ahora."
    mad "Yes, she broke up with you. She doesn't want to continue having the kind of relationship you had so far."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2590
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_b67fb6f4:

    # mad "Es una lástima... hacíais tan buena pareja..."
    mad "It's a pity... you made such a cute couple..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2591
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_6b6a3698:

    # mc "Pero no lo entiendo..."
    mc "But I don't get it..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2593
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_adff9d34:

    # mad "Es muy fácil de entender. Después de ver lo que puede ser tener una relación completa... romántica... contigo. No quiere tener un sucedáneo."
    mad "It's very easy to understand. After seeing what it can be like to have a full... romantic... relationship with you, she doesn't want to have an imitation of that kind of relationship."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2595
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_60be8291:

    # mad "Dice que fue divertido, pero que no es lo suyo. Prefiere perder su trabajo a perder la oportunidad de tener algo más sincero contigo."
    mad " She says it was fun, but it's not her thing. She'd rather lose her job than lose the chance to have something more sincere with you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2597
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_7a79c608:

    # mad "Dice que fue divertido, pero que no es lo suyo. Prefiere perder su poder, si es que lo tenía, a perder la oportunidad de tener algo más sincero contigo."
    mad " She says it was fun, but it's not her thing. She'd rather lose her power, if she ever had it, than lose the chance to have something more sincere with you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2598
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_49c884ea:

    # mc "Yo pienso lo mismo. Tú no estabas hoy en mi casa, pero con todo el mundo tengo una relación basada en el respeto, no en guardar secretos."
    mc "I feel the same way. You weren't at my house today, but I have a relationship with everyone based on respect, not on keeping secrets."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2599
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_5db10965:

    # mc "Yo esperaba que nuestra relación evolucionara hacia algo más romántico. Pero si ha roto conmigo, creo que debería irme..."
    mc "I hoped for our relationship to evolve into something more romantic. But if she broke up with me, I think I should leave..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2601
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_748c3ccd:

    # mad "¿Qué? ¡No!"
    mad "What? No!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2603
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_d8b39b3d:

    # mad "Digo..."
    mad "I mean..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2604
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_31d5dd14:

    # mad "Puedo hacer que Maddie vuelva, si quieres. Estoy segura de que le gustaría oir lo que has dicho."
    mad "I can get Maddie back, if you want. I'm sure she'd like to hear what you just said."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2605
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_74bfce3d:

    # mc "Sí, por favor. Hazla volver."
    mc "Yes, please. Bring her back."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2607
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_26028f2c:

    # mad "Un momento, por favor."
    mad "One moment, please."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2609
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_9c1cced8:

    # mad "Me ha dicho Claire que quieres hablar conmigo. Sobre por qué he roto contigo."
    mad "Claire told me you want to talk to me. About why I broke up with you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2610
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_ae0a59dd:

    # mc "¿A qué viene esto, Maddie?"
    mc "What's the point of this, Maddie?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2612
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_189eaa31:

    # mad "No sabía cómo decirte que quiero estar contigo... "
    mad "I didn't know how to tell you that I want to be with you... "

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2614
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_2701d7a4:

    # mad "... como estás con [mar]..."
    mad "... as you are with [mar]..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2616
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_715ea0d0:

    # mad "... como estás con el resto de las chicas..."
    mad "... as you are with the other girls..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2617
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_7fecd2e0:

    # mad "Quiero una relación de verdad. Me gusta mucho lo que tenemos, pero... después de ver lo que podría tener... quiero más."
    mad "I want a real relationship. I really like what we have, but... after seeing what I could have... I want more."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2618
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_05dbb4cf:

    # mc "Y se te ha ocurrido este juego."
    mc "And you came up with this game."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2620
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_61508003:

    # mad "Llevo desde la Gran Revelación pensando cómo hacerlo. Y al final no he usado ninguna de las ideas que tenía."
    mad "I've been thinking about how to do it since the Great Reveal. And, in the end, I haven't used any of the ideas I had."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2621
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_574339e8:

    # mad "Quería hablarlo en la piscina, pero justo en ese momento ha llegado Debbie..."
    mad "I wanted to talk about it by the pool, but just then, Debbie came in..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2622
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_c2ba7b18:

    # mad "Quiero olvidar lo que hemos hecho hasta ahora y empezar desde cero. ¿Crees que podríamos probarlo?"
    mad "I want to forget what we've done so far and start from scratch. Do you think we could try it?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2623
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_add99a6a:

    # mc "No. Lo siento, Maddie."
    mc "No, Maddie. I'm sorry."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2625
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_2215400f:

    # mad "Pero..."
    mad "But..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2626
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_8755a89a:

    # mc "Déjame hablar un momento."
    mc "Let me speak for a moment."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2627
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_b09238b8:

    # mc "No quiero olvidar lo que hemos hecho hasta ahora. Creo que la evolución natural de lo que estábamos haciendo es lo que vamos a hacer ahora."
    mc "I don't want to forget what we've done so far. I think the natural evolution of what we were doing is what we're going to do now."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2628
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_5d3aacf1:

    # mc "Pero eso no significa que no nos lo hayamos pasado bien."
    mc "But that doesn't mean we didn't have a good time."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2629
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_c3916d55:

    # mc "Podemos tener una relación de verdad, pero sin dejar de hacer las cosas divertidas que hemos hecho hasta ahora."
    mc "We can have a real relationship, but still do the fun things we've done so far."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2631
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_82109074:

    # mad "Me parece bien... ¿Significa que ahora soy una más de tus novias?"
    mad "Sounds good to me... Does this mean I'm just another one of your girlfriends now?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2632
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_d124f304:

    # mc "No me gustan las etiquetas, pero si a ti te gustan, sí, eres una más."
    mc "I don't like labels, but if you do, yes, you're one of them."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2634
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_8d834bb4:

    # "Maddie se lanza a tus brazos buscando tus labios en un beso lleno de alivio."
    "Maddie throws herself into your arms seeking your lips in a kiss full of relief."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2635
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_7c7f289f:

    # "El beso dura unos segundos antes de que se separe de ti."
    "The kiss lasts for a few seconds before she breaks away from you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2637
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_9ca2ff4a:

    # mad "¡Gracias, [mc]! Estaba aterrorizada de planteártelo."
    mad "Thank you, [mc]! I was terrified to bring this up."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2638
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_7217336c:

    # mc "No me des las gracias. Los dos ganamos con este cambio. Es lo que los dos queremos."
    mc "Don't thank me. We both win with this change. It's what we both want."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2640
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_bad70e44:

    # mc "Y nunca me pareció que estuvieras muy a gusto en el papel de dominatrix."
    mc "And you never struck me as being very comfortable in the role of a dominatrix."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2642
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_7e73f8d0:

    # mad "No, no lo estaba. Me gustó probarlo y tener el control... pensar que tenía el control..."
    mad "No, I wasn't. Although I liked trying it and being in control... or to think I was in control..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2644
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_7412199c:

