translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_046425b4:

    # mad "Si, lo estaba. Me gustó probarlo y saber que no tenía el control..."
    mad "Yes, I was. I liked trying it and knowing I wasn't in control..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2647
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_22dd7e9a:

    # mad "Pero no estoy hecha para eso. Soy demasiado... normal..."
    mad "But I'm not made for that. I'm too... normal..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2649
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_ccb07a8b:

    # mc "*Risa* No, Maddie. No eres normal. No creo que \"normal\" incluya compartir a su novio con otras mujeres."
    mc "*Laugh* No, Maddie. You're not normal. I don't think \"normalcy\" includes sharing your boyfriend with other women."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2651
translate english c20s005_GivingMaddieARide_57756bba:

    # mc "*Risa* No, Maddie. No eres normal. No creo que \"normal\" incluya compartir a su novio con su suegra."
