    kia "Yes. In front of all the girls..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2744
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_0469b98b:

    # mc "Y, por lo que me ha parecido, todas te han felicitado por dar el paso de dejar tu pasado atrás, ¿no?"
    mc "And, from what I gathered, they all congratulated you on taking the step of leaving your past behind, didn't they?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2745
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_54747eb3:

    # mc "Precisamente el día en que han visto cómo era tu pasado..."
    mc "Precisely on the day they saw what your past was like..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2747
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_4ae66f04:

