    kia "Yes... but it's my life, not theirs..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2748
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_7c906f37:

    # mc "Y ninguna de ellas te va a forzar a dar ningún paso que no quieras dar, Kiara."
    mc "And none of them are going to force you to take any steps you don't want to take, Kiara."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2750
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_738b57de:

