    kia "I don't know what is expected from me..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2752
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_9226b533:

    # mc "Nadie espera nada de ti. Lo que esperamos todos, yo incluído, es que consigas ser feliz en esta familia como no lo fuiste en tu familia anterior."
    mc "No one expects anything from you. What we all expect, me included, is that you get to be happy in this family like you weren't in your previous family."

