    kia "But I don't want to think about anything beyond that kiss... at least for now..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2779
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_62396cdf:

    # mc "No hay ningún problema con eso. No lo hay conmigo ni lo hay con nadie más. Porque nadie más que tú y yo decidiremos cuándo va a pasar."
    mc "There is no problem with that. There's not one with me and there's not one with anybody else. Because no one but you and I will decide when it's going to happen."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2781
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_6bc1b511:

    # kia "Entonces... ¿no te importa ir paso a paso?"
    kia "So... you don't mind taking it one step at a time?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2782
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_d7cc3734:

    # mc "No, no me importa. Es más, mañana te voy a invitar a cenar, si quieres."
    mc "No, I don't mind. What's more, I'm going to invite you to dinner tomorrow, if you want."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2783
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_d759bfe7:

    # mc "Quizás, si empezamos a salir como una pareja tradicional te sientas más cómoda. Pero sólamente si quieres ir a cenar conmigo. Nadie te puede forzar a ello."
    mc "Maybe, if we start dating as a traditional couple, you'll feel more comfortable. But only if you want to go to dinner with me. No one can force you into it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2785
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_62832fad:

    # kia "Sí, quiero. Pero mejor a comer. Si salimos de noche, Eileen me va a interrogar cuando volvamos."
    kia "Yes, I want to. But we'd better have lunch. If we go out at night, Eileen is going to question me when we get back."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2786
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_8b671804:

    # mc "Perfecto. Tenemos una cita para comer."
    mc "Perfect. We have a lunch date."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2787
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_0139acbd:

    # mc "Y recuerda que, aunque Eileen te interrogue, no tienes porqué contarle nada que no quieras contarle."
    mc "And remember that, even if Eileen interrogates you, you don't have to tell her anything you don't want to share."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2789
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_1e9ad038:

    # kia "Lo sé. Ni sentirme forzada a hacer lo que ella quiera que haga."
    kia "I know. Nor feel forced to do what she wants me to do."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2790
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_1ce75b02:

    # mc "Exacto."
    mc "I see you are getting it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2792
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_54968c6f:

    # kia "Aunque {b}tú{/b} la mandes a que me de la charla y me convenza de cosas, como has hecho esta tarde."
    kia "Even if {b}you{/b} send her to give me the talk and convince me of things, as you did this afternoon."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2793
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_c582738d:

    # mc "No, Kiara. No la he mandado a que te convenciera de nada. Estabas preocupada por cómo se sentiría si tú y yo empezábamos algo."
    mc "No, Kiara. I didn't send her to talk you into anything. You were worried about how she would feel if you and I started something."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2794
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_3979befc:

    # mc "Sólo le he dicho que te dijera cómo se sentiría. No tenía que ir más allá."
    mc "I just told her to tell you how she would feel. She didn't have to go any further."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2796
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_8fe26f31:

    # kia "*Risa* ¿No conoces a mi hija? ¿Creías que iba a parar después de decírmelo?"
    kia "*Laugh* Don't you know how my daughter is? Did you think she was going to stop after telling me that?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2797
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_ba48a9df:

    # mc "En un principio, sí, era lo que esperaba."
    mc "At first, yes, it was what I expected."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2798
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_feac233e:

    # mc "Cuando he visto cómo ha reaccionado cuando... durante el incidente... Creo que estaba muy ansiosa de librarse de su padre."
    mc "When I saw the way she reacted when... during the incident... I think she was very anxious to get rid of her father."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2800
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_01979e1c:

    # kia "Es gracioso que digas \"su padre\" en vez de \"Solomon\" o \"tu marido\"."
    kia "It's funny that you said \"her father\" instead of \"Solomon\" or \"your husband\"."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2801
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_b63ee2e1:

    # kia "Es como si no quisieras recordarme que estoy casada con el padre de Eileen."
    kia "It's like you don't want to remind me that I'm married to Eileen's father."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2802
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_aad7fbb8:

    # mc "Es que no quiero recordártelo. Estais casados sobre el papel, pero has dicho que no volverás con él nunca."
    mc "I don't want to remind you. You're married on paper, but you said you're never going back to him."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2803
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_190f1f31:

    # mc "En este caso, vuestro matrimonio es únicamente una formalidad hasta que te divorcies."
    mc "In this case, your marriage is only a formality until you get divorced. If you want to divorce, of course."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2805
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_20889386:

    # kia "Sabes que somos católicos, ¿verdad? Solomon nunca me concederá el divorcio."
    kia "You know we're Catholic, right? Solomon will never grant me a divorce."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2806
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_38c27be6:

    # mc "Pues tendremos que buscar alguna forma de adecuar nuestra relación a tus creencias religiosas."
    mc " Then we'll have to find some way to bring our relationship in line with your religious beliefs."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2807
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_b20eb053:

    # mc "No tengo ni idea de como puede afectarte esto."
    mc "I have no idea how this might affect you."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2809
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_bae4722e:

    # kia "Entonces todo arreglado. Mañana comemos juntos y ya veremos... A ver como evoluciona esto... ¿Nos vamos a dormir?"
    kia "Then it's all settled. Tomorrow we'll have lunch together and we'll see... Let's see how this relationship evolves... Shall we go to bed?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2810
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_dbeedd01:

    # mc "Sólo tengo una pregunta antes de irnos."
    mc "I just have one question before we go."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2811
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_7e031e08:

    # mc "El salto de cama que llevabas antes... ¿Ibas a ir a mi habitación? ¿Te había convencido Eileen?"
    mc "The nightie you were wearing earlier... Were you going to my room? Did Eileen talk you into it?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2813
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_31cf8c7e:

    # kia "Casi. Me había vestido así por si reunía el valor para hacerlo."
    kia "Almost. I dressed like that in case I mustered up the courage to do it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2814
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_e643b0b5:

    # kia "Cuando te he oído subir las escaleras, he pensado que sería un buen momento para hablarlo en vez de plantarme en tu habitación como una buscona."
    kia "When I heard you coming upstairs, I thought it would be a good time to talk about it, instead of barging into your room like a slut."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2816
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_76a469d6:

    # kia "Por lo que estaba diciendo Eile, tenías que estar ansioso por que lo hiciera."
    kia "From what Eile was saying, you had to be anxious for me to do it."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2817
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_c3f188e0:

    # kia "Por suerte, tenías que llevar a Maddie a casa y eso me ha salvado de hacer algo de lo que después seguramente me hubiera arrepentido."
    kia "Luckily, you had to take Maddie home, and that saved me from doing something I would have probably regretted later."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2819
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_2fb66a60:

    # kia "*Risa* No se lo tengas en cuenta a la chica."
    kia "*Laugh* Don't hold it against the girl."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2820
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_6a7e8bf5:

    # mc "Creo que es al revés. Creo que le tenemos que agradecer a Maddie que nos podamos tomar nuestro tiempo y hacer las cosas a nuestro ritmo."
    mc "I think it's the other way around. I think we have to thank Maddie that we can take our time and do things at our own pace."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2822
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_07cf9117:

    # kia "Visto así... tienes razón."
    kia " Looking at it that way... you're right."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2824
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_1f0aa400:

    # "Kiara se calza y se levanta para irse. Haces lo mismo."
    "Kiara puts on her shoes and gets up to leave. You do the same."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2825
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_fecf056e:

    # kia "¿Me acompañas a casa de [nor]?"
    kia "Will you walk me to [nor]'s house?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2826
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_48d5f2ce:

    # mc "Sólo si me prometes que esta vez habrá beso de despedida y que dejarás de llamarla casa de [nor]. También es tu casa ahora."
    mc "Only if you promise me that this time there will be a goodbye kiss and that you will stop calling it [nor]'s house. It's your house now, too."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2828
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_272ebc82:

    # kia "*Risa* Me parece bien. ¿Me acompañas a casa?"
    kia "*Laugh* Sounds good to me. Will you walk me home?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2829
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_997a1865:

    # mc "No has dicho nada del beso..."
    mc "You didn't say anything about the kiss..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2831
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_012de196:

    # "Kiara se lanza a por tus labios, con la misma dulzura y avidez que ha hecho por la tarde, sorprendiéndote con ambas."
    "Kiara darts for your lips, as sweetly and greedily as she has done in the afternoon, surprising you with a mix of eagerness and tenderness."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2833
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_6bf383c5:

    # kia "¿Te parece suficiente promesa?"
    kia "Does that look like enough promise to you?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2834
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_b32ecd82:

    # mc "Me parece perfecta."
    mc "I think it's perfect."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2836
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_cf33bef7:

    # "El camino de la piscina hasta la casa de [nor], la casa de Kiara, no os debería llevar más de dos o tres minutos. Os lleva más de quince."
    "The walk from the pool to [nor]'s house, Kiara's house, shouldn't take you more than two or three minutes. It takes you more than fifteen."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2838
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_79a713f1:

    # "Os paráis cada pocos metros para volver a besaros."
    "You stop every few yards to kiss again."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2840
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_f6f158a0:

    # "Y esos pocos metros los recorréis, a paso lento, cogidos de la mano, intentando alargar la experiencia lo máximo posible."
    "And in those few yards, you walk holding hands, at a slow pace, trying to stretch out the experience as long as possible."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2842
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_5fdefe13:

    # "Pero al final llegáis a la puerta principal. Un último beso antes de separaros."
    "But eventually you reach the front door. One last kiss before you part."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2844
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_0dba28f7:

    # kia "Pues hasta aquí ha llegado nuestro paseo..."
    kia "Well, this is as far as our walk goes..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2845
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_ab22a5bd:

    # mc "Si por mí fuera, lo podríamos repetir todas las noches."
    mc "If it were up to me, we could repeat it every night."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2847
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_63be4610:

    # kia "No creo que me sentara bien una ducha fría todas las noches a la 1:00 AM... o la hora que sea ya."
    kia "I don't think a cold shower every night at 1:00 AM... or whatever time it is now... would do me any good."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2848
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_5a9f0d9e:

    # mc "¿Vas a darte una ducha ahora?"
    mc "Are you going to shower now?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2850
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_245e31b5:

    # kia "No preguntes lo que no quieras saber. Y no te ofrezcas a enjabonarme la espalda. *Risa*"
    kia "Don't ask what you don't want to know. And don't offer to soap my back. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2851
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_dde5cc42:

    # mc "*Risa* No lo voy a hacer. Seguramente no me conformaría con la espalda."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm not going to do that. I surely wouldn't settle for only your back."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2853
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_0268ab97:

    # kia "Entonces, hasta mañana a la hora de comer, ¿no?"
    kia "So, until tomorrow lunchtime, right?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2854
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_f7213923:

    # mc "Sí, no creo que esté levantado cuando vayas a trabajar. ¿Quieres que te pase a buscar sobre la 1:00 PM?"
    mc "Yeah, I don't think I'll be up when you go to work. Do you want me to pick you up around 1:00 PM?"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2855
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_375bdc59:

    # kia "Es una buena hora. Normalmente salgo entre la 1:00 y la 1:30 a comer. Tengo una hora de tiempo."
    kia "Sure, that's a good time. I usually go out between 1:00 and 1:30 for lunch. I have a free hour."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2856
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_4b85b8a1:

    # mc "Buscaré algún sitio cerca de la biblioteca para ir a comer. Y no, no vamos a ir al puesto de los perritos calientes en nuestra primera cita."
    mc "I'll look for somewhere near the library to go for lunch. And no, we're not going to the hot dog stand on our first date."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2858
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_949e2cf6:

    # kia "*Risita* Me parece bien, aunque casi consideraría este paseo como nuestra primera cita."
    kia "*Giggle* Sounds good to me, though I'd almost consider this walk as our first date."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2859
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_270bcedd:

    # mc "Lo será si acaba en beso."
    mc "It will be if it ends in a kiss."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2861
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_08df730a:

    # "Acaba en beso. Un beso que dice que mañana habrá más. Un beso que sabe a despedida, aunque solo sea por doce horas."
    "It ends in a kiss. A kiss that says that there will be more tomorrow. A kiss that tastes like goodbye, even if it's only for twelve hours."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2862
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_be90d0b8:

    # "Un beso en el que no hay dudas, que empieza a un ritmo suave y que acelera poco a poco. Como esperas que pase con vuestra relación."
    "A kiss with no hesitation, which starts at a gentle pace and gradually speeds up. Just as you expect to happen with your relationship."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2864
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_d2b8a5a5:

    # kia "Hasta mañana, [mc]. Esperaré ansiosa que vengas a buscarme."
    kia "See you tomorrow, [mc]. I'll look forward to you coming to pick me up."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2865
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_de54c180:

    # mc "Hasta mañana, Kiara. Yo estaré ansioso por ir."
    mc "See you tomorrow, Kiara. I'll be eager to go."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2866
translate english c20s006_ReturningHome_39c53149:

    # mc "*Risa* Y tampoco vamos a ir al puesto de los perritos calientes en nuestra segunda cita, ahora que ésta cuenta como la primera."
    mc "*Laugh* And we're not going to the hot dog stand on our second date either, now that this one counts as our first."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2871
translate english c20s007_Teaser_ffbf891b:

    # "Al volver a tu habitación..."
    "On returning to your room..."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2873
translate english c20s007_Teaser_d72364f0:

    # emm "¡Has tardado muchísimo en volver!"
    emm "You took forever to return home!"

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2874
translate english c20s007_Teaser_433f4a0f:

    # dap "Estábamos a punto de irnos. Menos mal que has llegado ahora."
    dap "We were just about to leave. Good thing you arrived now."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2876
translate english c20s007_Teaser_5dab658f:

    # eri "Creíamos que te ibas a quedar a dormir en casa de Maddie."
    eri "We thought you were staying over at Maddie's place."

# game/scripts/c20/c20.rpy:2878
translate english c20s007_Teaser_37fa3aff:

    # eri "O de llamarte para saber si te había pasado algo."
    eri "Or about to call you to find out if something happened to you."

